{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YMbYDgw4XVz4bYEVNJXDgE","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — clkc_mech_interp\n2\t\n3\t> 最后更新: 2026-05-22 | 目标: ICLR 2027 (DDL ~2026-09-24)\n4\t\n5\t## Core Insight\n6\t\n7\t多语言 LLM 中，跨语言知识冲突的检测信号可在残差流中被线性探针检测，且跨语言迁移呈现**方向性不对称**（ZH→EN >> EN→ZH ~7.2pp），该不对称性跨架构高度一致（Llama-3.1-8B 与 Qwen3-8B）。这为 CLEAR (Zhao et al. 2026) 发现的 \"entity-centric factual conflicts 中 linguistic affinity 决定冲突解决\" 提供了首个**机制层面的解释**。\n8\t\n9\t**注意**: CLEAR 的发现是 task-dependent 的——entity-centric factual conflicts 由 linguistic affinity 主导，reasoning-intensive tasks 由 resource abundance 主导。我们使用 ConflictQA（entity-centric），引用 CLEAR 时必须限定为 entity-centric 场景。\n10\t\n11\t## Narrative Structure\n12\t\n13\t**现象驱动的机制解释**（非 \"applying X to Y\"）：\n14\t\n15\t1. **Phenomenon**: CLEAR 发现在 entity-centric factual conflicts 中，linguistic affinity（而非 resource abundance）决定跨语言冲突解决，但未提供机制解释\n16\t2. **Mechanistic question**: 冲突信号在模型内部如何编码？是 language-universal 还是 language-specific？为什么 similarity 起决定作用？\n17\t3. **Our answer**: 通过残差流探针、SAE 特征分析、激活干预三条互补分析轨道，揭示冲突检测信号的跨语言结构——是否共享、在哪些层出现、能否用于干预\n18\t\n19\t**Secondary framing**: SAE-based mechanistic interpretability 工具在跨语言条件下的 stress test——probing / SAE / steering 三种工具的跨语言适用性边界\n20\t\n21\t## Competing Hypotheses (pre-registered)\n22\t\n23\t**H1 — English-anchored universal detection**:\n24\t冲突检测信号本身是 language-independent 的（\"是否存在冲突\" 是语言无关判断），编码在 mid-layer 共享表征空间中。final-layer language transition 引入 similarity-dependent 干扰，影响 resolution 但不影响 detection。\n25\t- 预测: mid-layer conflict feature 跨语言 Jaccard >> late-layer Jaccard (paired permutation test p < 0.05)\n26\t- 预测: 英语探针跨语言迁移更强（英语作为训练数据主导语言，表征空间以英语为锚点）\n27\t\n28\t**H2 — Language-pair-specific encoding**:\n29\t冲突特征从 mid-layer 起即为 language-pair-specific 的，linguistic distance 直接编码在冲突表征中。\n30\t- 预测: mid-layer 和 late-layer Jaccard 无显著差异，或 mid < late\n31\t- 预测: 探针迁移准确率与语言对 typological distance 强相关\n32\t\n33\t**MVP 证据倾向**:\n34\t当前双模型结果倾向 **H1 的变体**——ZH→EN 迁移（71-72%）显著强于 EN→ZH（64-65%），暗示冲突信号以英语表征空间为锚点编码。非线性成分（MLP EN→ZH +9.2pp vs linear）提示 EN→ZH 方向的跨语言映射更复杂。\n35\t\n36\t## Core Claims\n37\t\n38\t### Claim 1: Cross-lingual conflict detectability\n39\t**Statement**: 跨语言知识冲突信号可在残差流中被线性探针检测，准确率显著高于随机基线。\n40\t**Evidence needed**:\n41\t- ≥2 model architectures 的 within-language probe acc > 70% (balanced) ✅ (Llama 77.1%, Qwen 75.3%)\n42\t- Permutation test p < 0.001 ✅ (all directions)\n43\t- Cross-lingual transfer acc > chance (50%) with statistical significance ✅ (all directions 64-72%)\n44\t**Status**: MVP 已验证 ✅\n45\t\n46\t### Claim 2: Asymmetric cross-lingual transfer\n47\t**Statement**: 跨语言探针迁移呈方向一致的不对称：ZH→EN 迁移强于 EN→ZH（~7.2pp），效果量跨架构高度一致（Llama 显著，Qwen 方向一致但未达显著）。\n48\t**Evidence needed**:\n49\t- Bootstrap CI for asymmetry gap (corrected, plan_099 ✅):\n50\t  - Llama: +7.22pp, CI [1.1%, 13.6%] — 排除零但 borderline ✅\n51\t  - Qwen: +7.18pp, CI [-1.2%, 13.4%] — 含零，方向一致 ⚠️\n52\t- ≥2 models show consistent effect size ✅ (7.22pp vs 7.18pp)\n53\t- Token overlap analysis 排除词汇重叠驱动的虚假迁移 ✅ (plan_101 完成: per-sample Jaccard 3-4%, Qwen 无相关 p>0.4, Llama 显著负相关 r=-0.15 p=0.012 — RC2 排除)\n54\t- ≥1 additional model architecture 验证跨架构一致性 ❌ (planned P0)\n55\t**Status**: 初步验证 ⚠️ (需补 token overlap + 第三模型)\n56\t\n57\t### Claim 3: Direction-dependent non-linear components\n58\t**Statement**: 跨语言冲突信号的弱迁移方向（EN→ZH）包含方向依赖的非线性成分，MLP 探针在该方向提升最大。跨架构一致方向但幅度不同（Llama +9.2pp single-seed / ~+4.7pp bootstrap-corrected, Qwen +2.3pp），暗示非线性成分与模型的跨语言对齐程度相关。\n59\t**Evidence needed**:\n60\t- MLP vs linear probe comparison on ≥2 models ✅ (both show EN→ZH direction gains)\n61\t- MLP 不使用 test set 做 early stopping ✅ (已修复)\n62\t- 控制实验排除 MLP 过拟合 ❌ (需 train/test accuracy gap 分析)\n63\t- 解释跨架构幅度差异 (Llama 4x > Qwen) ❌ (可能与 Qwen 更强的跨语言对齐有关——ZH 训练数据占比更高)\n64\t**Status**: 初步验证 ⚠️ (方向一致但幅度差异需解释)\n65\t\n66\t### Claim 4: Layer-wise conflict signal structure\n67\t**Statement**: 冲突信号在 mid-to-upper layers 集中，峰值层在不同模型架构中占比一致（Llama ~88% depth, Qwen ~67% depth 有差异——需更多模型确认 pattern）。\n68\t**Evidence needed**:\n69\t- Layer-wise probe accuracy curves for ≥3 models ❌\n70\t- Layer-wise CKA/SVCCA 量化 EN vs ZH 表征相似度 ❌\n71\t- 与 \"Lost in Multilinguality\" 的 language transition 层对比 ❌\n72\t**Status**: 未验证 ❌\n73\t\n74\t### Claim 5: Cross-lingual SAE conflict features (Track 2)\n75\t**Statement**: SAE 特征空间中存在跨语言共享的冲突编码特征，可与 language-identity 特征解耦。\n76\t**Evidence needed**:\n77\t- Qwen-Scope SAE 特征分析 on Qwen3-8B-Base ❌\n78\t- LangFIR random-token filtering 控制 ❌\n79\t- Cross-lingual feature Jaccard 分析 ❌\n80\t**Status**: 未开始 ❌\n81\t\n82\t### Claim 6: Cross-lingual conflict steering (Track 3)\n83\t**Statement**: 通过 SAE 特征干预可以定向操控跨语言冲突解决行为。\n84\t**Evidence needed**:\n85\t- SpARE 框架跨语言扩展 ❌\n86\t- Monolingual → cross-lingual steering transfer ❌\n87\t- Steering effectiveness vs linguistic distance correlation ❌\n88\t**Status**: 未开始 ❌ (依赖 Track 2)\n89\t\n90\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n91\t\n92\t### RC1: Translation quality confound [RESOLVED ✅]\n93\t**Concern**: 中文翻译质量差可能导致虚假的冲突信号或迁移失败\n94\t**Result**: Plan_105 COMET tercile ablation 证明翻译质量非 confounder。Qwen test: Low COMET (mean 0.585) → 66.35% acc, High COMET (mean 0.816) → 60.71% acc, delta=-5.64pp (反向), Fisher p=0.695。冲突信号检测不依赖翻译质量。Back-translation COMET ≥0.80 阈值过严（两步翻译天然拉低），但 ablation 实证排除了翻译质量 confound。\n95\t**Remaining**: Llama test COMET 完成后重复此分析确认一致性。\n96\t\n97\t### RC2: Token overlap confound [RESOLVED ✅]\n98\t**Concern**: 跨语言迁移可能由 EN-ZH 共享 token（数字、专有名词、标点）驱动\n99\t**Result**: Per-sample Jaccard 仅 3-4%（type-level 10-15% 被膨胀）。Qwen 无相关 (p>0.4)，Llama 显著负相关 (r=-0.15, p=0.012, tercile Δ=-23.9pp)。高 overlap 反而降低准确率，方向与 RC2 相反。**共享 token 不驱动跨语言迁移，迁移发生在语义表示层。**\n100\t\n101\t### RC3: Model coverage insufficient [HIGH]\n102\t**Concern**: 只有 2 个模型，无法声称 \"架构无关\"\n103\t**Mitigation**: 加 ≥1 不同架构（Mistral/Gemma），验证 ~7.2pp 不对称性\n104\t**Experiment**: P0 — additional model verification\n105\t\n106\t### RC4: Dataset size and diversity [MEDIUM]\n107\t**Concern**: ConflictQA 覆盖面有限（~1000 samples/model），只有 EN-ZH 一个语言对\n108\t**Mitigation**: Phase 1 聚焦 EN-ZH 验证核心机制，Phase 2 扩展多语言（≥1 额外语言对）\n109\t**Experiment**: P0 — multilingual extension (EN↔JA or EN↔DE)\n110\t\n111\t### RC5: Linear probe expressiveness [LOW]\n112\t**Concern**: 线性探针可能遗漏复杂非线性信号\n113\t**Mitigation**: MLP 对比实验已完成 ✅，非线性成分已量化\n114\t**Experiment**: Done — MLP vs Linear comparison\n115\t\n116\t### RC6: SAE base/instruct mismatch [MEDIUM]\n117\t**Concern**: Qwen-Scope SAE 训练在 base model 上，用于 instruct model 分析可能失配\n118\t**Mitigation**: Track 2 用 base model 做 SAE 分析 + 与 Track 1 instruct probe 交叉验证\n119\t**Experiment**: Track 2 设计已考虑\n120\t\n121\t### RC7: Steering failure precedent [MEDIUM]\n122\t**Concern**: \"Interpretability without actionability\" 证明 SAE steering 可能完全无效\n123\t**Mitigation**: 知识冲突与临床分诊的 5 维差异（SpARE 已证明知识冲突场景 steering 有效）；Track 3 显式报告失败模式\n124\t**Experiment**: Track 3 包含 negative result framing\n125\t\n126\t### RC8: Causal claims without intervention [HIGH]\n127\t**Concern**: 探针只证明信号可检测，不证明因果关系\n128\t**Mitigation**: Track 3 steering 实验提供因果证据；Track 1 permutation test 提供统计控制\n129\t**Experiment**: Track 3 steering + representation steering (P1)\n130\t\n131\t## Paper Structure (Tentative)\n132\t\n133\t1. **Introduction**: CLEAR gap → mechanistic question → H1 vs H2 → three-track approach → key findings preview\n134\t2. **Related Work**: Monolingual conflict mechanisms → Cross-lingual processing → SAE steering (successes & failures) → Cross-lingual SAE features\n135\t3. **Method**: Data construction (ConflictQA + translation + verification pipeline) → Track 1 probing → Track 2 SAE analysis → Track 3 steering\n136\t4. **Experiments & Results**:\n137\t   - 4.1 Cross-lingual conflict detectability (C1)\n138\t   - 4.2 Asymmetric transfer analysis (C2) + token overlap controls\n139\t   - 4.3 Non-linear components (C3) + layer-wise structure (C4)\n140\t   - 4.4 SAE feature analysis (C5) [if Track 2 ready]\n141\t   - 4.5 Steering experiments (C6) [if Track 3 ready]\n142\t5. **Discussion**: H1 vs H2 resolution → mechanism implications → limitations → connection to CLEAR\n143\t6. **Conclusion**\n144\t\n145\t## Scope Control\n146\t\n147\t**投稿最低要求 (must-have for submission)**:\n148\t- Claims 1-3 fully supported (cross-lingual detectability + asymmetry + non-linearity)\n149\t- Claim 4 partially supported (layer-wise analysis on ≥2 models)\n150\t- ≥3 model architectures\n151\t- ≥2 language pairs (EN-ZH + one more)\n152\t- Token overlap control\n153\t- COMET translation quality validation\n154\t\n155\t**理想状态 (nice-to-have)**:\n156\t- Track 2 SAE analysis (Claim 5)\n157\t- Track 3 steering (Claim 6)\n158\t- 5+ language pairs covering multiple typological families\n159\t- Full CKA/SVCCA layer analysis\n160\t\n161\t**不做 (out of scope)**:\n162\t- 10-language full CLEAR replication\n163\t- Custom SAE training\n164\t- MoE model analysis\n165\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e8bbcfe2-4536-4e05-a4c5-615fca01f226","uuid":"b698b022-32bc-4153-8d2c-0e5021fa1248","timestamp":"2026-05-22T03:01:01.203Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod42/projects/clkc_mech_interp/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T023801/median/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — clkc_mech_interp\n\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-22 | 目标: ICLR 2027 (DDL ~2026-09-24)\n\n## Core Insight\n\n多语言 LLM 中，跨语言知识冲突的检测信号可在残差流中被线性探针检测，且跨语言迁移呈现**方向性不对称**（ZH→EN >> EN→ZH ~7.2pp），该不对称性跨架构高度一致（Llama-3.1-8B 与 Qwen3-8B）。这为 CLEAR (Zhao et al. 2026) 发现的 \"entity-centric factual conflicts 中 linguistic affinity 决定冲突解决\" 提供了首个**机制层面的解释**。\n\n**注意**: CLEAR 的发现是 task-dependent 的——entity-centric factual conflicts 由 linguistic affinity 主导，reasoning-intensive tasks 由 resource abundance 主导。我们使用 ConflictQA（entity-centric），引用 CLEAR 时必须限定为 entity-centric 场景。\n\n## Narrative Structure\n\n**现象驱动的机制解释**（非 \"applying X to Y\"）：\n\n1. **Phenomenon**: CLEAR 发现在 entity-centric factual conflicts 中，linguistic affinity（而非 resource abundance）决定跨语言冲突解决，但未提供机制解释\n2. **Mechanistic question**: 冲突信号在模型内部如何编码？是 language-universal 还是 language-specific？为什么 similarity 起决定作用？\n3. **Our answer**: 通过残差流探针、SAE 特征分析、激活干预三条互补分析轨道，揭示冲突检测信号的跨语言结构——是否共享、在哪些层出现、能否用于干预\n\n**Secondary framing**: SAE-based mechanistic interpretability 工具在跨语言条件下的 stress test——probing / SAE / steering 三种工具的跨语言适用性边界\n\n## Competing Hypotheses (pre-registered)\n\n**H1 — English-anchored universal detection**:\n冲突检测信号本身是 language-independent 的（\"是否存在冲突\" 是语言无关判断），编码在 mid-layer 共享表征空间中。final-layer language transition 引入 similarity-dependent 干扰，影响 resolution 但不影响 detection。\n- 预测: mid-layer conflict feature 跨语言 Jaccard >> late-layer Jaccard (paired permutation test p < 0.05)\n- 预测: 英语探针跨语言迁移更强（英语作为训练数据主导语言，表征空间以英语为锚点）\n\n**H2 — Language-pair-specific encoding**:\n冲突特征从 mid-layer 起即为 language-pair-specific 的，linguistic distance 直接编码在冲突表征中。\n- 预测: mid-layer 和 late-layer Jaccard 无显著差异，或 mid < late\n- 预测: 探针迁移准确率与语言对 typological distance 强相关\n\n**MVP 证据倾向**:\n当前双模型结果倾向 **H1 的变体**——ZH→EN 迁移（71-72%）显著强于 EN→ZH（64-65%），暗示冲突信号以英语表征空间为锚点编码。非线性成分（MLP EN→ZH +9.2pp vs linear）提示 EN→ZH 方向的跨语言映射更复杂。\n\n## Core Claims\n\n### Claim 1: Cross-lingual conflict detectability\n**Statement**: 跨语言知识冲突信号可在残差流中被线性探针检测，准确率显著高于随机基线。\n**Evidence needed**:\n- ≥2 model architectures 的 within-language probe acc > 70% (balanced) ✅ (Llama 77.1%, Qwen 75.3%)\n- Permutation test p < 0.001 ✅ (all directions)\n- Cross-lingual transfer acc > chance (50%) with statistical significance ✅ (all directions 64-72%)\n**Status**: MVP 已验证 ✅\n\n### Claim 2: Asymmetric cross-lingual transfer\n**Statement**: 跨语言探针迁移呈方向一致的不对称：ZH→EN 迁移强于 EN→ZH（~7.2pp），效果量跨架构高度一致（Llama 显著，Qwen 方向一致但未达显著）。\n**Evidence needed**:\n- Bootstrap CI for asymmetry gap (corrected, plan_099 ✅):\n  - Llama: +7.22pp, CI [1.1%, 13.6%] — 排除零但 borderline ✅\n  - Qwen: +7.18pp, CI [-1.2%, 13.4%] — 含零，方向一致 ⚠️\n- ≥2 models show consistent effect size ✅ (7.22pp vs 7.18pp)\n- Token overlap analysis 排除词汇重叠驱动的虚假迁移 ✅ (plan_101 完成: per-sample Jaccard 3-4%, Qwen 无相关 p>0.4, Llama 显著负相关 r=-0.15 p=0.012 — RC2 排除)\n- ≥1 additional model architecture 验证跨架构一致性 ❌ (planned P0)\n**Status**: 初步验证 ⚠️ (需补 token overlap + 第三模型)\n\n### Claim 3: Direction-dependent non-linear components\n**Statement**: 跨语言冲突信号的弱迁移方向（EN→ZH）包含方向依赖的非线性成分，MLP 探针在该方向提升最大。跨架构一致方向但幅度不同（Llama +9.2pp single-seed / ~+4.7pp bootstrap-corrected, Qwen +2.3pp），暗示非线性成分与模型的跨语言对齐程度相关。\n**Evidence needed**:\n- MLP vs linear probe comparison on ≥2 models ✅ (both show EN→ZH direction gains)\n- MLP 不使用 test set 做 early stopping ✅ (已修复)\n- 控制实验排除 MLP 过拟合 ❌ (需 train/test accuracy gap 分析)\n- 解释跨架构幅度差异 (Llama 4x > Qwen) ❌ (可能与 Qwen 更强的跨语言对齐有关——ZH 训练数据占比更高)\n**Status**: 初步验证 ⚠️ (方向一致但幅度差异需解释)\n\n### Claim 4: Layer-wise conflict signal structure\n**Statement**: 冲突信号在 mid-to-upper layers 集中，峰值层在不同模型架构中占比一致（Llama ~88% depth, Qwen ~67% depth 有差异——需更多模型确认 pattern）。\n**Evidence needed**:\n- Layer-wise probe accuracy curves for ≥3 models ❌\n- Layer-wise CKA/SVCCA 量化 EN vs ZH 表征相似度 ❌\n- 与 \"Lost in Multilinguality\" 的 language transition 层对比 ❌\n**Status**: 未验证 ❌\n\n### Claim 5: Cross-lingual SAE conflict features (Track 2)\n**Statement**: SAE 特征空间中存在跨语言共享的冲突编码特征，可与 language-identity 特征解耦。\n**Evidence needed**:\n- Qwen-Scope SAE 特征分析 on Qwen3-8B-Base ❌\n- LangFIR random-token filtering 控制 ❌\n- Cross-lingual feature Jaccard 分析 ❌\n**Status**: 未开始 ❌\n\n### Claim 6: Cross-lingual conflict steering (Track 3)\n**Statement**: 通过 SAE 特征干预可以定向操控跨语言冲突解决行为。\n**Evidence needed**:\n- SpARE 框架跨语言扩展 ❌\n- Monolingual → cross-lingual steering transfer ❌\n- Steering effectiveness vs linguistic distance correlation ❌\n**Status**: 未开始 ❌ (依赖 Track 2)\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n### RC1: Translation quality confound [RESOLVED ✅]\n**Concern**: 中文翻译质量差可能导致虚假的冲突信号或迁移失败\n**Result**: Plan_105 COMET tercile ablation 证明翻译质量非 confounder。Qwen test: Low COMET (mean 0.585) → 66.35% acc, High COMET (mean 0.816) → 60.71% acc, delta=-5.64pp (反向), Fisher p=0.695。冲突信号检测不依赖翻译质量。Back-translation COMET ≥0.80 阈值过严（两步翻译天然拉低），但 ablation 实证排除了翻译质量 confound。\n**Remaining**: Llama test COMET 完成后重复此分析确认一致性。\n\n### RC2: Token overlap confound [RESOLVED ✅]\n**Concern**: 跨语言迁移可能由 EN-ZH 共享 token（数字、专有名词、标点）驱动\n**Result**: Per-sample Jaccard 仅 3-4%（type-level 10-15% 被膨胀）。Qwen 无相关 (p>0.4)，Llama 显著负相关 (r=-0.15, p=0.012, tercile Δ=-23.9pp)。高 overlap 反而降低准确率，方向与 RC2 相反。**共享 token 不驱动跨语言迁移，迁移发生在语义表示层。**\n\n### RC3: Model coverage insufficient [HIGH]\n**Concern**: 只有 2 个模型，无法声称 \"架构无关\"\n**Mitigation**: 加 ≥1 不同架构（Mistral/Gemma），验证 ~7.2pp 不对称性\n**Experiment**: P0 — additional model verification\n\n### RC4: Dataset size and diversity [MEDIUM]\n**Concern**: ConflictQA 覆盖面有限（~1000 samples/model），只有 EN-ZH 一个语言对\n**Mitigation**: Phase 1 聚焦 EN-ZH 验证核心机制，Phase 2 扩展多语言（≥1 额外语言对）\n**Experiment**: P0 — multilingual extension (EN↔JA or EN↔DE)\n\n### RC5: Linear probe expressiveness [LOW]\n**Concern**: 线性探针可能遗漏复杂非线性信号\n**Mitigation**: MLP 对比实验已完成 ✅，非线性成分已量化\n**Experiment**: Done — MLP vs Linear comparison\n\n### RC6: SAE base/instruct mismatch [MEDIUM]\n**Concern**: Qwen-Scope SAE 训练在 base model 上，用于 instruct model 分析可能失配\n**Mitigation**: Track 2 用 base model 做 SAE 分析 + 与 Track 1 instruct probe 交叉验证\n**Experiment**: Track 2 设计已考虑\n\n### RC7: Steering failure precedent [MEDIUM]\n**Concern**: \"Interpretability without actionability\" 证明 SAE steering 可能完全无效\n**Mitigation**: 知识冲突与临床分诊的 5 维差异（SpARE 已证明知识冲突场景 steering 有效）；Track 3 显式报告失败模式\n**Experiment**: Track 3 包含 negative result framing\n\n### RC8: Causal claims without intervention [HIGH]\n**Concern**: 探针只证明信号可检测，不证明因果关系\n**Mitigation**: Track 3 steering 实验提供因果证据；Track 1 permutation test 提供统计控制\n**Experiment**: Track 3 steering + representation steering (P1)\n\n## Paper Structure (Tentative)\n\n1. **Introduction**: CLEAR gap → mechanistic question → H1 vs H2 → three-track approach → key findings preview\n2. **Related Work**: Monolingual conflict mechanisms → Cross-lingual processing → SAE steering (successes & failures) → Cross-lingual SAE features\n3. **Method**: Data construction (ConflictQA + translation + verification pipeline) → Track 1 probing → Track 2 SAE analysis → Track 3 steering\n4. **Experiments & Results**:\n   - 4.1 Cross-lingual conflict detectability (C1)\n   - 4.2 Asymmetric transfer analysis (C2) + token overlap controls\n   - 4.3 Non-linear components (C3) + layer-wise structure (C4)\n   - 4.4 SAE feature analysis (C5) [if Track 2 ready]\n   - 4.5 Steering experiments (C6) [if Track 3 ready]\n5. **Discussion**: H1 vs H2 resolution → mechanism implications → limitations → connection to CLEAR\n6. **Conclusion**\n\n## Scope Control\n\n**投稿最低要求 (must-have for submission)**:\n- Claims 1-3 fully supported (cross-lingual detectability + asymmetry + non-linearity)\n- Claim 4 partially supported (layer-wise analysis on ≥2 models)\n- ≥3 model architectures\n- ≥2 language pairs (EN-ZH + one more)\n- Token overlap control\n- COMET translation quality validation\n\n**理想状态 (nice-to-have)**:\n- Track 2 SAE analysis (Claim 5)\n- Track 3 steering (Claim 6)\n- 5+ language pairs covering multiple typological families\n- Full CKA/SVCCA layer analysis\n\n**不做 (out of scope)**:\n- 10-language full CLEAR replication\n- Custom SAE training\n- MoE model analysis\n","numLines":165,"startLine":1,"totalLines":165}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LVx9jzoxGuqEB1yUmcxLNk","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"第三模型架构验证\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"在 Gemma-2-9B-IT 上重复完整探针实验，验证 ~7.2pp 不对称性跨架构一致性\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"model\": \"Gemma-2-9B-IT\",\n7\t      \"en_en_bal_acc\": 0.731,\n8\t      \"zh_zh_bal_acc\": 0.694,\n9\t      \"en_zh_bal_acc\": 0.641,\n10\t      \"zh_en_bal_acc\": 0.695,\n11\t      \"asymmetry_gap_pp\": 5.4,\n12\t      \"bootstrap_ci_95\": \"[-0.8%, 11.6%]\",\n13\t      \"bootstrap_significant\": false,\n14\t      \"positive_iterations_of_100\": 94,\n15\t      \"permutation_p_en_en\": \"<0.001\",\n16\t      \"permutation_p_zh_zh\": \"<0.001\",\n17\t      \"permutation_p_en_zh\": 0.006,\n18\t      \"permutation_p_zh_en\": \"<0.001\",\n19\t      \"best_layer_en\": 23,\n20\t      \"best_layer_zh\": 20,\n21\t      \"best_layer_depth_pct\": 0.72,\n22\t      \"mlp_en_zh_gain_pp\": 3.1,\n23\t      \"mlp_zh_en_gain_pp\": 0.8,\n24\t      \"token_overlap_jaccard_mean\": 0.035,\n25\t      \"token_overlap_correlation_p\": 0.31\n26\t    },\n27\t    \"tables\": [\n28\t      {\n29\t        \"caption\": \"Gemma-2-9B-IT probe transfer accuracy (balanced accuracy, n=100 bootstrap)\",\n30\t        \"columns\": [\n31\t          \"Train→Test\",\n32\t          \"Bal. Acc (%)\",\n33\t          \"95% CI\",\n34\t          \"Perm. p\"\n35\t        ],\n36\t        \"rows\": [\n37\t          [\n38\t            \"EN→EN\",\n39\t            \"73.1\",\n40\t            \"[70.2, 76.0]\",\n41\t            \"<0.001\"\n42\t          ],\n43\t          [\n44\t            \"ZH→ZH\",\n45\t            \"69.4\",\n46\t            \"[66.3, 72.5]\",\n47\t            \"<0.001\"\n48\t          ],\n49\t          [\n50\t            \"EN→ZH\",\n51\t            \"64.1\",\n52\t            \"[59.9, 68.3]\",\n53\t            \"0.006\"\n54\t          ],\n55\t          [\n56\t            \"ZH→EN\",\n57\t            \"69.5\",\n58\t            \"[65.7, 73.3]\",\n59\t            \"<0.001\"\n60\t          ],\n61\t          [\n62\t            \"Gap (ZH→EN − EN→ZH)\",\n63\t            \"+5.4\",\n64\t            \"[-0.8, 11.6]\",\n65\t            \"—\"\n66\t          ]\n67\t        ]\n68\t      },\n69\t      {\n70\t        \"caption\": \"Cross-architecture asymmetry consistency (all three models)\",\n71\t        \"columns\": [\n72\t          \"Model\",\n73\t          \"Gap (pp)\",\n74\t          \"95% CI\",\n75\t          \"Significant?\",\n76\t          \"Direction\"\n77\t        ],\n78\t        \"rows\": [\n79\t          [\n80\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n81\t            \"7.22\",\n82\t            \"[1.1, 13.6]\",\n83\t            \"Yes (borderline)\",\n84\t            \"ZH→EN > EN→ZH\"\n85\t          ],\n86\t          [\n87\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n88\t            \"7.18\",\n89\t            \"[-1.2, 13.4]\",\n90\t            \"No\",\n91\t            \"ZH→EN > EN→ZH\"\n92\t          ],\n93\t          [\n94\t            \"Gemma-2-9B-IT\",\n95\t            \"5.4\",\n96\t            \"[-0.8, 11.6]\",\n97\t            \"No\",\n98\t            \"ZH→EN > EN→ZH\"\n99\t          ],\n100\t          [\n101\t            \"Mean ± SD\",\n102\t            \"6.60 ± 1.04\",\n103\t            \"—\",\n104\t            \"1/3 sig, 3/3 consistent\",\n105\t            \"—\"\n106\t          ]\n107\t        ]\n108\t      }\n109\t    ],\n110\t    \"figures\": [],\n111\t    \"analysis\": \"三模型 effect size: 7.22, 7.18, 5.4 → mean=6.60, SD=1.04pp。Cochran's Q test 跨\\n模型一致性 p=0.68（无显著异质性）。Gemma 偏低 1.8pp 可解释为架构效应而非方向不一致。\\n关键叙事: \\\"In all three architectures spanning two distinct design families (GQA vs\\nparallel attention), the ZH→EN transfer consistently exceeded EN→ZH, with a pooled\\neffect of 6.6pp (range 5.4–7.2). Only Llama reached conventional significance\\n(p<0.05), but the I² heterogeneity statistic of 0% and consistent directionality\\nacross 3/3 models provides stronger evidence than any single p-value.\\\"\\nCohen's d range: 0.32-0.48 (small-to-medium)。对 Cumming (2014) framing 足够。\\nC2 claim 降级为: \\\"consistent directional asymmetry with stable effect size\\\" 而非\\n\\\"statistically significant asymmetry\\\"。\\n\\n\\nGemma-2-9B-IT 使用 parallel attention + GeGLU，与 Llama (sequential GQA) 和 Qwen\\n(sequential GQA + RoPE variant) 架构差异最大。within-lang acc 落在 0.69-0.73 因 Gemma\\n多语言训练配比适中（英语占优但中文覆盖不如 Qwen）。不对称性方向一致（ZH→EN > EN→ZH）\\n源于相同底层机制——英语作为训练主导语言的表征锚点效应——与架构无关。但 gap 缩小至 5.4pp\\n（vs 7.2pp），因 Gemma 的 parallel attention 提供更均匀的跨层信息流动，降低了方向性\\n映射难度差异。CI 含零因: (1) 样本量 ~1000 在 5.4pp effect 下 power 不足, (2) Gemma\\n的 attention pattern 引入更大 per-sample 方差。94/100 bootstrap 正向但不足以排除零。\\nMLP gain +3.1pp 弱方向，介于 Qwen(2.3pp) 和 Llama(4.7pp corrected) 之间。\\nbest_layer 深度 72% 与 Qwen(67%) 更接近而非 Llama(88%)，暗示峰值层与架构深度分配\\n有关而非固定比例——C4 需更多模型确认 pattern。\\n\"\n112\t  },\n113\t  {\n114\t    \"name\": \"多语言扩展 (EN↔JA)\",\n115\t    \"description\": \"扩展到 EN↔JA 语言对，测试不对称性是否与 typological distance 相关\",\n116\t    \"results\": {\n117\t      \"model_tested\": \"Llama-3.1-8B (primary) + Qwen3-8B (if time permits)\",\n118\t      \"ja_translation_comet_mean\": 0.74,\n119\t      \"ja_translation_pass_rate_080\": 0.22,\n120\t      \"en_en_bal_acc\": 0.771,\n121\t      \"ja_ja_bal_acc\": 0.673,\n122\t      \"en_ja_bal_acc\": 0.612,\n123\t      \"ja_en_bal_acc\": 0.658,\n124\t      \"asymmetry_gap_pp\": 4.6,\n125\t      \"bootstrap_ci_95\": \"[-2.1%, 11.3%]\",\n126\t      \"bootstrap_significant\": false,\n127\t      \"positive_iterations_of_100\": 88,\n128\t      \"sample_size_ja\": 680,\n129\t      \"conflictqa_ja_coverage\": 0.68\n130\t    },\n131\t    \"tables\": [\n132\t      {\n133\t        \"caption\": \"EN↔JA probe transfer (Llama-3.1-8B, n=680)\",\n134\t        \"columns\": [\n135\t          \"Train→Test\",\n136\t          \"Bal. Acc (%)\",\n137\t          \"95% CI\",\n138\t          \"Perm. p\"\n139\t        ],\n140\t        \"rows\": [\n141\t          [\n142\t            \"EN→EN\",\n143\t            \"77.1\",\n144\t            \"[74.3, 79.9]\",\n145\t            \"<0.001\"\n146\t          ],\n147\t          [\n148\t            \"JA→JA\",\n149\t            \"67.3\",\n150\t            \"[63.5, 71.1]\",\n151\t            \"<0.001\"\n152\t          ],\n153\t          [\n154\t            \"EN→JA\",\n155\t            \"61.2\",\n156\t            \"[56.9, 65.5]\",\n157\t            \"0.021\"\n158\t          ],\n159\t          [\n160\t            \"JA→EN\",\n161\t            \"65.8\",\n162\t            \"[61.6, 70.0]\",\n163\t            \"0.002\"\n164\t          ],\n165\t          [\n166\t            \"Gap (JA→EN − EN→JA)\",\n167\t            \"+4.6\",\n168\t            \"[-2.1, 11.3]\",\n169\t            \"—\"\n170\t          ]\n171\t        ]\n172\t      },\n173\t      {\n174\t        \"caption\": \"Cross-language-pair asymmetry comparison\",\n175\t        \"columns\": [\n176\t          \"Language Pair\",\n177\t          \"Gap (pp)\",\n178\t          \"95% CI\",\n179\t          \"n\",\n180\t          \"Direction\"\n181\t        ],\n182\t        \"rows\": [\n183\t          [\n184\t            \"EN↔ZH (Llama)\",\n185\t            \"7.22\",\n186\t            \"[1.1, 13.6]\",\n187\t            \"~1000\",\n188\t            \"ZH→EN > EN→ZH\"\n189\t          ],\n190\t          [\n191\t            \"EN↔JA (Llama)\",\n192\t            \"4.6\",\n193\t            \"[-2.1, 11.3]\",\n194\t            \"~680\",\n195\t            \"JA→EN > EN→JA\"\n196\t          ]\n197\t        ]\n198\t      }\n199\t    ],\n200\t    \"figures\": [],\n201\t    \"analysis\": \"EN↔JA 方向一致支持 H1 的 English-anchored 假设——不管目标语言是 ZH 还是 JA，\\nX→EN 迁移都优于 EN→X。但 gap 差异 (7.2 vs 4.6pp) 的解释有混淆: 可能是\\ntypological distance 效应 (支持 H2 的弱形式) 或纯粹是 sample size/coverage 导致的\\npower 差异。此实验为 \\\"方向一致但样本量不足以单独显著\\\" 的典型 median-tier 结果。\\n论文中作为 supplementary evidence 放 Discussion，不宜作为独立 claim。\\n贡献: 将 lang_pairs_validated 从 1 提升到 2，满足 RC4 的最低要求。\\n\\n\\nJA 预测结果弱于 ZH 有三个原因: (1) ConflictQA 中 JA 实体覆盖率低于 ZH（Wikidata\\nJA 标签覆盖不如 ZH），可用样本 ~680 vs ZH ~1000; (2) JA 作为 agglutinative 语言，\\ntokenizer 切分更碎片化，信息密度/token 低于 ZH，探针输入质量略降; (3) Llama-3.1 的\\nJA 训练数据占比低于 ZH，within-lang acc 偏低。\\n不对称性方向一致（JA→EN > EN→JA）因相同锚点机制——英语表征空间主导。gap 4.6pp 略\\n小于 ZH 的 7.2pp，可能因 JA-EN typological distance 大于 ZH-EN（JA 是 SOV 语序 +\\nagglutinative，ZH 是 SVO + isolating），映射两个方向都更难，压缩了不对称性。\\nCI 含零主要因样本量不足 (n=680) 导致 power 严重不足。direction consistency 才是关键。\\n这个结果对 H1 vs H2 判别力弱——两个假说都兼容此 pattern。需更多语言对（DE, AR）\\n才能有效区分。\\n\"\n202\t  },\n203\t  {\n204\t    \"name\": \"Layer-wise CKA/SVCCA\",\n205\t    \"description\": \"逐层 CKA + SVCCA 分析 EN vs ZH 表征相似度变化，对接 language transition 文献\",\n206\t    \"results\": {\n207\t      \"cka_early_layers_0_to_25pct\": 0.92,\n208\t      \"cka_mid_layers_25_to_60pct\": 0.78,\n209\t      \"cka_upper_layers_60_to_85pct\": 0.71,\n210\t      \"cka_final_layers_85_to_100pct\": 0.63,\n211\t      \"svcca_correlation_with_cka\": 0.94,\n212\t      \"language_transition_onset_layer_pct\": 0.55,\n213\t      \"probe_peak_vs_cka_drop_correlation\": -0.67,\n214\t      \"cka_conflict_vs_nonconflict_diff_peak_layer\": 0.08\n215\t    },\n216\t    \"tables\": [\n217\t      {\n218\t        \"caption\": \"Layer-wise CKA between EN and ZH conflict activations (Llama-3.1-8B)\",\n219\t        \"columns\": [\n220\t          \"Layer Range\",\n221\t          \"Depth %\",\n222\t          \"CKA (mean)\",\n223\t          \"CKA (std)\",\n224\t          \"Probe Acc (%)\"\n225\t        ],\n226\t        \"rows\": [\n227\t          [\n228\t            \"0-8\",\n229\t            \"0-25%\",\n230\t            \"0.92\",\n231\t            \"0.03\",\n232\t            \"54.2\"\n233\t          ],\n234\t          [\n235\t            \"8-19\",\n236\t            \"25-60%\",\n237\t            \"0.78\",\n238\t            \"0.05\",\n239\t            \"62.8\"\n240\t          ],\n241\t          [\n242\t            \"19-27\",\n243\t            \"60-85%\",\n244\t            \"0.71\",\n245\t            \"0.04\",\n246\t            \"73.6\"\n247\t          ],\n248\t          [\n249\t            \"27-32\",\n250\t            \"85-100%\",\n251\t            \"0.63\",\n252\t            \"0.06\",\n253\t            \"69.1\"\n254\t          ]\n255\t        ]\n256\t      },\n257\t      {\n258\t        \"caption\": \"Language transition onset across models\",\n259\t        \"columns\": [\n260\t          \"Model\",\n261\t          \"Transition Onset (%)\",\n262\t          \"Probe Peak (%)\",\n263\t          \"CKA at Peak\"\n264\t        ],\n265\t        \"rows\": [\n266\t          [\n267\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n268\t            \"55%\",\n269\t            \"88%\",\n270\t            \"0.64\"\n271\t          ],\n272\t          [\n273\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n274\t            \"50%\",\n275\t            \"67%\",\n276\t            \"0.73\"\n277\t          ],\n278\t          [\n279\t            \"Gemma-2-9B-IT\",\n280\t            \"52%\",\n281\t            \"72%\",\n282\t            \"0.70\"\n283\t          ]\n284\t        ]\n285\t      }\n286\t    ],\n287\t    \"figures\": [],\n288\t    \"analysis\": \"CKA 下降曲线 + probe peak 的共现为 C4 提供了 mechanistic 叙事: \\\"冲突信号在语言表征\\n从 universal 向 specific 转变的过程中达到峰值\\\"。但三模型 peak 层分散 (67-88%)\\n削弱了 \\\"固定比例\\\" 的 claim。改为: \\\"conflict detection peaks during the language\\ntransition window, whose exact location is architecture-dependent\\\"。\\nCKA conflict vs non-conflict 差异 (0.08) 太小，不支持 \\\"冲突改变了跨语言对齐\\\" 这种\\n强 claim。应限定为描述性发现。此实验是论文 Section 4.3 的核心图表来源。\\n\\n\\nCKA 从 early layers (~0.92) 单调下降到 final layers (~0.63) 符合 \\\"Lost in\\nMultilinguality\\\" (Wendler et al. 2024) 的 language transition 预测: 模型在 mid-upper\\nlayers 开始将 language-universal 语义表征转换为 language-specific 输出表征。\\ntransition onset ~55% depth 与 Wendler 的 60% 接近（Wendler 用更大模型，transition\\n更靠后）。probe accuracy peak 出现在 CKA 开始快速下降的区域——这是核心发现:\\n冲突信号在语言表征开始分化的 \\\"临界层\\\" 最强，暗示冲突检测发生在 universal→specific\\ntransition 过程中。但 conflict vs non-conflict 的 CKA 差异仅 0.08（peak 层），\\n不够大到支持强结论。SVCCA 与 CKA 高度一致 (r=0.94) 增加方法鲁棒性。\\n此实验提供 C4 (layer structure) 的核心证据，但 peak 层跨模型不一致 (Llama 88%,\\nQwen 67%, Gemma 72%) 使得 \\\"universal pattern\\\" claim 困难。\\n\"\n289\t  },\n290\t  {\n291\t    \"name\": \"Representation steering (干预实验)\",\n292\t    \"description\": \"用探针方向作 steering vector 干预残差流，测量模型输出的因果变化\",\n293\t    \"results\": {\n294\t      \"steering_method\": \"probe_weight_direction_addition\",\n295\t      \"strong_direction_zh_en_flip_rate\": 0.34,\n296\t      \"weak_direction_en_zh_flip_rate\": 0.18,\n297\t      \"steering_alpha_optimal\": 3.5,\n298\t      \"coherence_preservation_rate\": 0.72,\n299\t      \"parametric_to_contextual_flip_rate\": 0.28,\n300\t      \"contextual_to_parametric_flip_rate\": 0.22,\n301\t      \"random_direction_flip_rate\": 0.06,\n302\t      \"steering_effect_significant\": true,\n303\t      \"steering_effect_size_cohens_d\": 0.41\n304\t    },\n305\t    \"tables\": [\n306\t      {\n307\t        \"caption\": \"Steering intervention results (Llama-3.1-8B, best layer)\",\n308\t        \"columns\": [\n309\t          \"Condition\",\n310\t          \"Flip Rate (%)\",\n311\t          \"Coherence (%)\",\n312\t          \"Random Ctrl (%)\"\n313\t        ],\n314\t        \"rows\": [\n315\t          [\n316\t            \"ZH→EN probe direction\",\n317\t            \"34.2\",\n318\t            \"74.1\",\n319\t            \"5.8\"\n320\t          ],\n321\t          [\n322\t            \"EN→ZH probe direction\",\n323\t            \"18.1\",\n324\t            \"71.3\",\n325\t            \"6.2\"\n326\t          ],\n327\t          [\n328\t            \"Averaged probe direction\",\n329\t            \"26.5\",\n330\t            \"72.8\",\n331\t            \"6.0\"\n332\t          ],\n333\t          [\n334\t            \"Random orthogonal direction\",\n335\t            \"6.0\",\n336\t            \"89.5\",\n337\t            \"—\"\n338\t          ]\n339\t        ]\n340\t      },\n341\t      {\n342\t        \"caption\": \"Steering alpha sensitivity (ZH→EN direction)\",\n343\t        \"columns\": [\n344\t          \"Alpha\",\n345\t          \"Flip Rate (%)\",\n346\t          \"Coherence (%)\",\n347\t          \"Net Useful Flips (%)\"\n348\t        ],\n349\t        \"rows\": [\n350\t          [\n351\t            \"1.0\",\n352\t            \"12.3\",\n353\t            \"91.2\",\n354\t            \"11.2\"\n355\t          ],\n356\t          [\n357\t            \"2.0\",\n358\t            \"22.8\",\n359\t            \"84.6\",\n360\t            \"19.3\"\n361\t          ],\n362\t          [\n363\t            \"3.5\",\n364\t            \"34.2\",\n365\t            \"74.1\",\n366\t            \"25.3\"\n367\t          ],\n368\t          [\n369\t            \"5.0\",\n370\t            \"38.9\",\n371\t            \"58.3\",\n372\t            \"22.7\"\n373\t          ],\n374\t          [\n375\t            \"7.0\",\n376\t            \"41.2\",\n377\t            \"42.1\",\n378\t            \"17.3\"\n379\t          ]\n380\t        ]\n381\t      }\n382\t    ],\n383\t    \"figures\": [],\n384\t    \"analysis\": \"Steering 提供了有限但实在的因果证据: probe direction 操纵可改变输出，且效果与\\nrandom direction 显著不同 (p<0.001)。但 34% flip rate 不足以声称 \\\"冲突信号因果\\n控制冲突解决\\\"——更准确的 framing 是 \\\"探针捕获的方向与冲突解决机制相关联\\\"。\\n论文中放在 Discussion 的 \\\"Towards Causal Understanding\\\" 小节，明确 limitation:\\n\\\"Our steering results provide correlational evidence consistent with a causal role\\nfor the detected conflict signal. Definitive causal claims require activation\\npatching or distributed alignment search, which we leave to future work.\\\"\\n不对称 flip rate (34 vs 18%) 与探针不对称性 echo，strengthens C2 narrative。\\n\\n\\nProbe weight 方向包含冲突检测信号但非纯因果方向——探针学到的是 \\\"与冲突相关的方差方向\\\"\\n而非 \\\"因果控制冲突解决的方向\\\"。因此 flip rate 偏低 (~18-34%) 而非理想的 50%+。\\nZH→EN 方向 flip rate (34%) 高于 EN→ZH (18%)，与探针迁移不对称性一致: ZH→EN\\n探针捕获了更纯粹的冲突信号，steering 更有效。EN→ZH 方向的非线性成分 (MLP gain)\\n意味着线性 steering vector 无法充分捕获该方向的冲突信号。\\nalpha=3.5 是 coherence-effectiveness trade-off: 过大导致输出退化 (coherence < 60%),\\n过小无效果。random direction control (6% flip) 证明效果非随机。\\nCohen's d=0.41 (medium) 提供 \\\"correlational evidence consistent with causal role\\\"\\n但不是 clean causal demonstration (那需要 activation patching 或 DAS)。\\n此实验在 Track 3 缺席时成为 RC8 的唯一因果证据来源。\\n\"\n385\t  },\n386\t  {\n387\t    \"name\": \"探针权重可视化 + PCA\",\n388\t    \"description\": \"最优层探针权重 PCA/t-SNE 可视化，展示冲突 vs 非冲突的表征分布\",\n389\t    \"results\": {\n390\t      \"pca_variance_explained_2d\": 0.23,\n391\t      \"conflict_nonconflict_cluster_silhouette\": 0.31,\n392\t      \"en_zh_overlap_coefficient_mid_layer\": 0.62,\n393\t      \"en_zh_overlap_coefficient_late_layer\": 0.41,\n394\t      \"cross_lingual_centroid_distance_mid\": 1.24,\n395\t      \"cross_lingual_centroid_distance_late\": 2.08\n396\t    },\n397\t    \"tables\": [\n398\t      {\n399\t        \"caption\": \"PCA cluster metrics across layers\",\n400\t        \"columns\": [\n401\t          \"Layer\",\n402\t          \"Depth %\",\n403\t          \"Silhouette\",\n404\t          \"EN-ZH Overlap\",\n405\t          \"Centroid Dist.\"\n406\t        ],\n407\t        \"rows\": [\n408\t          [\n409\t            \"Layer 10\",\n410\t            \"31%\",\n411\t            \"0.18\",\n412\t            \"0.78\",\n413\t            \"0.82\"\n414\t          ],\n415\t          [\n416\t            \"Layer 18\",\n417\t            \"56%\",\n418\t            \"0.28\",\n419\t            \"0.62\",\n420\t            \"1.24\"\n421\t          ],\n422\t          [\n423\t            \"Layer 25\",\n424\t            \"78%\",\n425\t            \"0.31\",\n426\t            \"0.48\",\n427\t            \"1.73\"\n428\t          ],\n429\t          [\n430\t            \"Layer 28\",\n431\t            \"88%\",\n432\t            \"0.34\",\n433\t            \"0.41\",\n434\t            \"2.08\"\n435\t          ]\n436\t        ]\n437\t      }\n438\t    ],\n439\t    \"figures\": [],\n440\t    \"analysis\": \"PCA 可视化的价值是 illustrative 而非 evidentiary。主要功能: (1) 直觉展示 \\\"冲突信号\\n为什么能跨语言迁移\\\"——mid-layer 两种语言的 conflict 表征在同一区域; (2) 直觉展示\\n\\\"为什么迁移不完美\\\"——overlap 不是 100%。不应过度解读 silhouette 值。\\n放在论文 Figure 3，caption 明确标注 \\\"illustrative; quantitative analysis in Table 2\\\"。\\n\\n\\n前 2 PC 仅解释 23% 方差——高维表征在低维投影中信息丢失严重，这是 known limitation。\\nSilhouette 0.31 (weak clustering) 意味着 conflict vs non-conflict 不是 clean 分离\\n而是有 substantial overlap，符合 balanced accuracy ~75% (非 95%+) 的预期。\\n关键定性发现: mid-layer 中 EN 和 ZH conflict 点云的重叠 (overlap=0.62) 显著高于\\nlate-layer (0.41)——支持 H1 的 \\\"mid-layer 共享表征\\\" 假设。EN conflict 和 ZH\\nconflict 的 centroid distance 从 mid (1.24) 到 late (2.08) 增大，与 CKA 下降一致。\\n但这是低维投影的定性证据，不能独立支持 claim。作为 Figure 3 (illustrative) 使用。\\n\"\n441\t  },\n442\t  {\n443\t    \"name\": \"Label noise ablation\",\n444\t    \"description\": \"注入 5-20% label noise 评估探针对 verification pipeline 标注错误的鲁棒性\",\n445\t    \"results\": {\n446\t      \"noise_0pct_acc\": 0.771,\n447\t      \"noise_5pct_acc\": 0.758,\n448\t      \"noise_10pct_acc\": 0.738,\n449\t      \"noise_15pct_acc\": 0.704,\n450\t      \"noise_20pct_acc\": 0.668,\n451\t      \"degradation_5pct_pp\": -1.3,\n452\t      \"degradation_10pct_pp\": -3.3,\n453\t      \"degradation_15pct_pp\": -6.7,\n454\t      \"degradation_20pct_pp\": -10.3,\n455\t      \"estimated_pipeline_error_rate\": 0.04,\n456\t      \"noise_tolerance_threshold\": 0.1\n457\t    },\n458\t    \"tables\": [\n459\t      {\n460\t        \"caption\": \"Probe accuracy under systematic label noise (Llama-3.1-8B, EN→EN)\",\n461\t        \"columns\": [\n462\t          \"Noise Rate\",\n463\t          \"Bal. Acc (%)\",\n464\t          \"Delta (pp)\",\n465\t          \"95% CI\"\n466\t        ],\n467\t        \"rows\": [\n468\t          [\n469\t            \"0%\",\n470\t            \"77.1\",\n471\t            \"—\",\n472\t            \"[74.3, 79.9]\"\n473\t          ],\n474\t          [\n475\t            \"5%\",\n476\t            \"75.8\",\n477\t            \"-1.3\",\n478\t            \"[72.9, 78.7]\"\n479\t          ],\n480\t          [\n481\t            \"10%\",\n482\t            \"73.8\",\n483\t            \"-3.3\",\n484\t            \"[70.7, 76.9]\"\n485\t          ],\n486\t          [\n487\t            \"15%\",\n488\t            \"70.4\",\n489\t            \"-6.7\",\n490\t            \"[67.0, 73.8]\"\n491\t          ],\n492\t          [\n493\t            \"20%\",\n494\t            \"66.8\",\n495\t            \"-10.3\",\n496\t            \"[63.1, 70.5]\"\n497\t          ]\n498\t        ]\n499\t      }\n500\t    ],\n501\t    \"figures\": [],\n502\t    \"analysis\": \"Pipeline error rate 4% 处的 accuracy 损失仅 ~1pp，远小于 CI 宽度——label noise\\n对结论无实质影响。此实验直接回应 \\\"你的 verification pipeline 可能有错\\\" 的 reviewer\\nconcern，以实验代替争论。放 Appendix，一图一表足够。\\n\\n\\n探针在 0-10% noise 下温和退化（-1 到 -3pp），10-20% 区间加速退化——典型的线性探针\\nnoise sensitivity 曲线。此 pattern 因线性模型对 label noise 的 theoretical\\nrobustness: 当 noise 远低于 signal (acc >> 50%), label flips 对决策边界影响被多数\\n正确样本 \\\"稀释\\\"。但超过 ~10% 后 signal-to-noise 下降导致边界显著偏移。\\nverification pipeline (ConflictQA 的 parametric/contextual answer 匹配) 的估计\\nerror rate ~4%，远低于 10% tolerance threshold。这证明 C1 的探针 accuracy 不是\\nlabel noise 的 artifact。补充 Appendix A 的 robustness 证据。\\n\"\n503\t  },\n504\t  {\n505\t    \"name\": \"更大数据集验证\",\n506\t    \"description\": \"扩大到 2000+ samples 或引入额外数据集验证 C1\",\n507\t    \"results\": {\n508\t      \"expanded_sample_size\": 1800,\n509\t      \"expansion_method\": \"ConflictQA additional sampling + ParaRel-conflict subset\",\n510\t      \"en_en_acc_expanded\": 0.765,\n511\t      \"asymmetry_gap_pp_expanded\": 7.0,\n512\t      \"ci_width_reduction_pct\": 35,\n513\t      \"bootstrap_ci_expanded\": \"[2.3%, 11.7%]\",\n514\t      \"bootstrap_significant_expanded\": true,\n515\t      \"new_dataset_consistency\": 0.92\n516\t    },\n517\t    \"tables\": [\n518\t      {\n519\t        \"caption\": \"Dataset expansion effect on asymmetry CI (Llama-3.1-8B)\",\n520\t        \"columns\": [\n521\t          \"Dataset\",\n522\t          \"n\",\n523\t          \"Gap (pp)\",\n524\t          \"95% CI\",\n525\t          \"Significant?\"\n526\t        ],\n527\t        \"rows\": [\n528\t          [\n529\t            \"ConflictQA original\",\n530\t            \"~1000\",\n531\t            \"7.22\",\n532\t            \"[1.1, 13.6]\",\n533\t            \"Yes (borderline)\"\n534\t          ],\n535\t          [\n536\t            \"ConflictQA expanded\",\n537\t            \"~1500\",\n538\t            \"7.0\",\n539\t            \"[1.8, 12.2]\",\n540\t            \"Yes\"\n541\t          ],\n542\t          [\n543\t            \"+ ParaRel subset\",\n544\t            \"~1800\",\n545\t            \"7.0\",\n546\t            \"[2.3, 11.7]\",\n547\t            \"Yes\"\n548\t          ]\n549\t        ]\n550\t      }\n551\t    ],\n552\t    \"figures\": [],\n553\t    \"analysis\": \"主要价值: 将 Llama 从 borderline significant 提升为 comfortably significant，\\n增强 C2 的统计基础。但如果 Qwen 仍不显著，核心叙事不变——仍是 \\\"consistent effect\\nsize, varying power\\\"。此实验是 \\\"nice to have\\\" 而非 game-changer。\\n若时间紧张，优先做 plan_102 (第三模型) 和 plan_107 (steering) 而非此项。\\n\\n\\n样本量从 ~1000 扩至 ~1800 (1.8x) 使 CI 宽度缩减约 35% (sqrt(1.8) ≈ 1.34 倍\\nprecision)。在 Llama 上，这足以将 borderline significant CI [1.1, 13.6] 收紧为\\n[2.3, 11.7]——更 comfortably 排除零。但 Qwen 可能仍含零 (从 [-1.2, 13.4] 到\\n[-0.2, 12.5] 左右)。within-lang accuracy 略降 (77.1→76.5) 因新增样本包含更多\\n\\\"difficult\\\" cases (ConflictQA 的 easy cases 先被采样)。\\nParaRel-conflict subset 与 ConflictQA 的一致性 0.92 (探针在两个数据集的准确率\\n高度相关) 增加 ecological validity。但此实验 P1 优先级在 median tier 下可能\\n不完整——若只完成 ConflictQA 扩展 (n=1500) 而没做 ParaRel，仍有价值但有限。\\n\"\n554\t  },\n555\t  {\n556\t    \"name\": \"Qwen-Scope SAE 冲突特征识别\",\n557\t    \"description\": \"用 Qwen-Scope 预训练 SAE 分析冲突激活的差异化特征\",\n558\t    \"results\": {\n559\t      \"sae_model\": \"Qwen-Scope (Qwen3-8B-Base)\",\n560\t      \"total_sae_features\": 65536,\n561\t      \"conflict_activated_features_top\": 280,\n562\t      \"mi_selected_features\": 45,\n563\t      \"mi_threshold\": 0.15,\n564\t      \"top_feature_activation_diff\": 2.3,\n565\t      \"feature_interpretability_rate\": 0.35,\n566\t      \"cross_lingual_overlap_top_features\": 8,\n567\t      \"noise_level\": \"high\",\n568\t      \"base_instruct_mismatch_cosine\": 0.71\n569\t    },\n570\t    \"tables\": [\n571\t      {\n572\t        \"caption\": \"SAE conflict feature statistics (Qwen-Scope, layer 22)\",\n573\t        \"columns\": [\n574\t          \"Metric\",\n575\t          \"EN\",\n576\t          \"ZH\",\n577\t          \"Overlap\"\n578\t        ],\n579\t        \"rows\": [\n580\t          [\n581\t            \"Activated features (>2σ)\",\n582\t            \"312\",\n583\t            \"256\",\n584\t            \"78\"\n585\t          ],\n586\t          [\n587\t            \"MI-selected (>0.15)\",\n588\t            \"45\",\n589\t            \"42\",\n590\t            \"8\"\n591\t          ],\n592\t          [\n593\t            \"Interpretable (manual)\",\n594\t            \"16/45\",\n595\t            \"14/42\",\n596\t            \"3/8\"\n597\t          ],\n598\t          [\n599\t            \"Mean activation diff (conflict-control)\",\n600\t            \"2.31\",\n601\t            \"1.87\",\n602\t            \"—\"\n603\t          ]\n604\t        ]\n605\t      }\n606\t    ],\n607\t    \"figures\": [],\n608\t    \"analysis\": \"Track 2 在 median tier 下产出 noisy 但非完全无用的结果。关键判断: base/instruct\\nmismatch 是主要 noise 来源而非冲突信号不存在。论文中可报告为:\\n\\\"Preliminary SAE analysis using Qwen-Scope identified candidate conflict features,\\nbut the base-instruct distribution shift (cosine similarity 0.71) introduced\\nsubstantial noise. We report these results in Appendix B with the caveat that\\nSAE analysis on matched base-model activations is needed for definitive conclusions.\\\"\\n此实验本身成为 Track 2 的 \\\"learned limitation\\\"——方法论贡献。\\n\\n\\nQwen-Scope SAE 训练在 base model，用于 instruct model 分析存在分布偏移 (RC6)。\\nBase-instruct cosine similarity ~0.71 意味着约 30% 的激活模式不对齐，导致 SAE\\nreconstruction quality 下降，特征识别 noisy。MI-selected 45 个特征中，手动检查\\n可解释的仅 35% (其余激活模式无法对应到 human-interpretable concept)。\\nconflict-activated 特征数 (280) 远多于预期——许多是 false positive，因 base/instruct\\nmismatch 导致 SAE 将 instruct-specific pattern 误解码为多个稀疏特征。\\nEN 和 ZH 的 top MI features 重叠仅 8 个 (8/45 ≈ 18%)，初步看似支持 H2\\n(language-specific)，但更可能是 noise + mismatch artifact。此结果在 median tier\\n属于 \\\"results noisy\\\" 范畴，不足以支持 C5 claim。\\n\"\n609\t  },\n610\t  {\n611\t    \"name\": \"LangFIR 语言特征解耦\",\n612\t    \"description\": \"LangFIR random-token filtering 识别 language-identity 特征并从 conflict features 中排除\",\n613\t    \"results\": {\n614\t      \"langfir_language_features_identified\": 120,\n615\t      \"conflict_language_overlap\": 22,\n616\t      \"overlap_rate\": 0.49,\n617\t      \"residual_conflict_features_after_filtering\": 23,\n618\t      \"residual_cross_lingual_overlap\": 3,\n619\t      \"residual_interpretability\": 0.22\n620\t    },\n621\t    \"tables\": [\n622\t      {\n623\t        \"caption\": \"LangFIR conflict-language feature decomposition\",\n624\t        \"columns\": [\n625\t          \"Category\",\n626\t          \"Count\",\n627\t          \"Cross-lingual Overlap\",\n628\t          \"Interpretable\"\n629\t        ],\n630\t        \"rows\": [\n631\t          [\n632\t            \"All MI-selected conflict features\",\n633\t            \"45\",\n634\t            \"8 (18%)\",\n635\t            \"16 (36%)\"\n636\t          ],\n637\t          [\n638\t            \"Language-identity features (LangFIR)\",\n639\t            \"120\",\n640\t            \"—\",\n641\t            \"—\"\n642\t          ],\n643\t          [\n644\t            \"Conflict ∩ Language\",\n645\t            \"22\",\n646\t            \"—\",\n647\t            \"—\"\n648\t          ],\n649\t          [\n650\t            \"Residual conflict (post-filter)\",\n651\t            \"23\",\n652\t            \"3 (13%)\",\n653\t            \"5 (22%)\"\n654\t          ]\n655\t        ]\n656\t      }\n657\t    ],\n658\t    \"figures\": [],\n659\t    \"analysis\": \"实验执行完整但结论受限于上游 SAE noise。不作为论文 main body 内容。\\n若包含，放 Appendix B 作为 \\\"preliminary investigation\\\" 连同 plan_201 一起报告。\\n关键 takeaway 写入 future work: \\\"SAE analysis on base-model activations with\\nmatched training distribution is a critical next step.\\\"\\n\\n\\nLangFIR 能较 robustly 地识别 language-identity 特征（random token 下仍激活的\\n特征 → language encoding），但当 SAE 本身 noisy (plan_201) 时，conflict features\\n和 language features 的 overlap 判定不可靠。overlap_rate 0.49 暗示约半数 \\\"conflict\\nfeatures\\\" 实际是 language features 被误标——进一步证实 plan_201 的 noise 问题。\\nfiltering 后剩余 23 个 conflict features 中跨语言重叠仅 3 个，可解释性更低 (22%)。\\n此结果不足以支持 \\\"conflict 和 language 特征可解耦\\\" 的 C5 子 claim。\\n在 median tier 下，此实验更多暴露了 base/instruct mismatch 的下游影响。\\n\"\n660\t  },\n661\t  {\n662\t    \"name\": \"Cross-lingual feature Jaccard 分析\",\n663\t    \"description\": \"计算 mid vs late layer conflict feature 的跨语言 Jaccard 以检验 H1 vs H2\",\n664\t    \"results\": {\n665\t      \"jaccard_mid_layer\": 0.06,\n666\t      \"jaccard_late_layer\": 0.04,\n667\t      \"jaccard_diff\": 0.02,\n668\t      \"permutation_p_mid_vs_late\": 0.38,\n669\t      \"h1_supported\": \"inconclusive\",\n670\t      \"h2_supported\": \"inconclusive\"\n671\t    },\n672\t    \"tables\": [\n673\t      {\n674\t        \"caption\": \"Cross-lingual conflict feature Jaccard by layer group\",\n675\t        \"columns\": [\n676\t          \"Layer Group\",\n677\t          \"Depth %\",\n678\t          \"EN features\",\n679\t          \"ZH features\",\n680\t          \"Jaccard\",\n681\t          \"Perm. p\"\n682\t        ],\n683\t        \"rows\": [\n684\t          [\n685\t            \"Mid (layers 10-18)\",\n686\t            \"31-56%\",\n687\t            \"38\",\n688\t            \"32\",\n689\t            \"0.06\",\n690\t            \"—\"\n691\t          ],\n692\t          [\n693\t            \"Late (layers 25-30)\",\n694\t            \"78-94%\",\n695\t            \"28\",\n696\t            \"24\",\n697\t            \"0.04\",\n698\t            \"—\"\n699\t          ],\n700\t          [\n701\t            \"Mid − Late diff\",\n702\t            \"—\",\n703\t            \"—\",\n704\t            \"—\",\n705\t            \"+0.02\",\n706\t            \"0.38\"\n707\t          ]\n708\t        ]\n709\t      }\n710\t    ],\n711\t    \"figures\": [],\n712\t    \"analysis\": \"Track 2 三个实验 (201→202→203) 的级联结果: 上游 noise 使最终 H1/H2 检验无效。\\n这不是 failure——是 honest methodology boundary。论文 Discussion 中写:\\n\\\"Our SAE-based analysis was limited by the base-instruct distribution mismatch\\n(Section B.1). The near-zero Jaccard indices reflect measurement noise rather\\nthan genuine absence of cross-lingual feature sharing. We consider SAE analysis\\nwith matched training distributions a high-priority direction for future work.\\\"\\nTrack 2 整体作为 Appendix B (2-3 pages)，emphasize method + limitation > results。\\n\\n\\n在 median tier 下 Jaccard < 0.10 是核心假设。mid-layer 0.06 vs late-layer 0.04\\n方向上支持 H1 (mid > late) 但差异极小且不显著 (p=0.38)。这是 plan_201 的 noise\\n传播的必然结果: 当 individual feature 识别不可靠时，feature 间的 overlap 计算\\n更不可靠。两个很小的 noisy set 的 Jaccard 天然趋近零。\\n此结果不支持也不反驳 H1 或 H2——是 \\\"inconclusive\\\" 而非 \\\"negative\\\"。区别重要:\\nnegative result 意味着 \\\"我们有 power 检测差异但没发现\\\"；inconclusive 意味着\\n\\\"我们的工具精度不足以检验此假设\\\"。\\n\"\n713\t  },\n714\t  {\n715\t    \"name\": \"Monolingual→cross-lingual steering transfer\",\n716\t    \"description\": \"用 SpARE 的英语冲突特征做 cross-lingual steering\",\n717\t    \"results\": {\n718\t      \"status\": \"not_executed\",\n719\t      \"reason\": \"depends on plan_201 + plan_203; Track 2 results too noisy to select reliable steering features\"\n720\t    },\n721\t    \"tables\": [],\n722\t    \"figures\": [],\n723\t    \"analysis\": \"Track 3 不执行。论文 Section 6 (Discussion) 标注:\\n\\\"Track 3 steering experiments were deferred due to limitations in SAE feature\\nidentification (Appendix B). Probe-based representation steering (Section 4.4)\\nprovides preliminary causal evidence. Full SAE-based steering across language\\npairs remains an important direction for future work.\\\"\\n\\n\\nTrack 3 依赖 Track 2 提供的 SAE conflict features 作为 steering targets。\\nPlan_201 的 noisy results 意味着无法可靠选择 steering features——用 noise-dominated\\nfeatures 做 steering 实验会产出 uninterpretable 结果。在 median tier 下\\ntracks_submission_ready = 1 (仅 Track 1)，Track 3 不执行是正确决策。\\nplan_107 (representation steering using probe weights) 作为替代提供有限因果证据。\\n\"\n724\t  },\n725\t  {\n726\t    \"name\": \"Cross-lingual-specific steering\",\n727\t    \"description\": \"用跨语言特有特征构建 steering vectors 并与 monolingual 对比\",\n728\t    \"results\": {\n729\t      \"status\": \"not_executed\",\n730\t      \"reason\": \"depends on plan_301 which is not executed\"\n731\t    },\n732\t    \"tables\": [],\n733\t    \"figures\": [],\n734\t    \"analysis\": \"同 plan_301。Track 3 整体 deferred to future work。\\n\\nPlan_302 依赖 plan_301 的 monolingual steering 基线。级联未执行。\\n\"\n735\t  },\n736\t  {\n737\t    \"name\": \"Typological steering correlation\",\n738\t    \"description\": \"Steering 有效性与 CLEAR linguistic similarity metric 的相关性\",\n739\t    \"results\": {\n740\t      \"status\": \"not_executed\",\n741\t      \"reason\": \"depends on plan_301 + plan_103; neither fully available\"\n742\t    },\n743\t    \"tables\": [],\n744\t    \"figures\": [],\n745\t    \"analysis\": \"Track 3 三个实验均 deferred。论文中 Track 3 仅作为 \\\"planned future work\\\" 出现在\\nSection 6.2 (Future Directions)，与 \\\"custom SAE training on matched distributions\\\"\\n并列为两大 follow-up 方向。这不损害 ICLR 投稿——现象发现 + 方法论贡献 + honest\\nboundary delineation 是 reviewer 尊重的 pattern。\\n\\n即使 plan_103 (EN↔JA) 完成，plan_301 未执行意味着无 steering effectiveness\\n数据可与 linguistic similarity 做相关分析。此实验是 \\\"CLEAR 因果链接\\\" 的最终拼图，\\n在 median tier 下明确归入 future work。\\n替代叙事: plan_103 的 probe transfer asymmetry 跨语言对的 pattern (EN↔ZH vs\\nEN↔JA) 提供 \\\"correlational hint\\\"——如果两个语言对的 gap 与 typological distance\\n弱相关，可在 Discussion 中提及但不作为 claim。\\n\"\n746\t  }\n747\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e8bbcfe2-4536-4e05-a4c5-615fca01f226","uuid":"386ff63d-1c8e-4d50-a624-6c6a096cb63e","timestamp":"2026-05-22T03:01:01.493Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod42/projects/clkc_mech_interp/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T023801/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"第三模型架构验证\",\n    \"description\": \"在 Gemma-2-9B-IT 上重复完整探针实验，验证 ~7.2pp 不对称性跨架构一致性\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"model\": \"Gemma-2-9B-IT\",\n      \"en_en_bal_acc\": 0.731,\n      \"zh_zh_bal_acc\": 0.694,\n      \"en_zh_bal_acc\": 0.641,\n      \"zh_en_bal_acc\": 0.695,\n      \"asymmetry_gap_pp\": 5.4,\n      \"bootstrap_ci_95\": \"[-0.8%, 11.6%]\",\n      \"bootstrap_significant\": false,\n      \"positive_iterations_of_100\": 94,\n      \"permutation_p_en_en\": \"<0.001\",\n      \"permutation_p_zh_zh\": \"<0.001\",\n      \"permutation_p_en_zh\": 0.006,\n      \"permutation_p_zh_en\": \"<0.001\",\n      \"best_layer_en\": 23,\n      \"best_layer_zh\": 20,\n      \"best_layer_depth_pct\": 0.72,\n      \"mlp_en_zh_gain_pp\": 3.1,\n      \"mlp_zh_en_gain_pp\": 0.8,\n      \"token_overlap_jaccard_mean\": 0.035,\n      \"token_overlap_correlation_p\": 0.31\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Gemma-2-9B-IT probe transfer accuracy (balanced accuracy, n=100 bootstrap)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Train→Test\",\n          \"Bal. Acc (%)\",\n          \"95% CI\",\n          \"Perm. p\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"EN→EN\",\n            \"73.1\",\n            \"[70.2, 76.0]\",\n            \"<0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ZH→ZH\",\n            \"69.4\",\n            \"[66.3, 72.5]\",\n            \"<0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"EN→ZH\",\n            \"64.1\",\n            \"[59.9, 68.3]\",\n            \"0.006\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ZH→EN\",\n            \"69.5\",\n            \"[65.7, 73.3]\",\n            \"<0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Gap (ZH→EN − EN→ZH)\",\n            \"+5.4\",\n            \"[-0.8, 11.6]\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Cross-architecture asymmetry consistency (all three models)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Gap (pp)\",\n          \"95% CI\",\n          \"Significant?\",\n          \"Direction\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            \"7.22\",\n            \"[1.1, 13.6]\",\n            \"Yes (borderline)\",\n            \"ZH→EN > EN→ZH\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            \"7.18\",\n            \"[-1.2, 13.4]\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"ZH→EN > EN→ZH\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Gemma-2-9B-IT\",\n            \"5.4\",\n            \"[-0.8, 11.6]\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"ZH→EN > EN→ZH\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mean ± SD\",\n            \"6.60 ± 1.04\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"1/3 sig, 3/3 consistent\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"三模型 effect size: 7.22, 7.18, 5.4 → mean=6.60, SD=1.04pp。Cochran's Q test 跨\\n模型一致性 p=0.68（无显著异质性）。Gemma 偏低 1.8pp 可解释为架构效应而非方向不一致。\\n关键叙事: \\\"In all three architectures spanning two distinct design families (GQA vs\\nparallel attention), the ZH→EN transfer consistently exceeded EN→ZH, with a pooled\\neffect of 6.6pp (range 5.4–7.2). Only Llama reached conventional significance\\n(p<0.05), but the I² heterogeneity statistic of 0% and consistent directionality\\nacross 3/3 models provides stronger evidence than any single p-value.\\\"\\nCohen's d range: 0.32-0.48 (small-to-medium)。对 Cumming (2014) framing 足够。\\nC2 claim 降级为: \\\"consistent directional asymmetry with stable effect size\\\" 而非\\n\\\"statistically significant asymmetry\\\"。\\n\\n\\nGemma-2-9B-IT 使用 parallel attention + GeGLU，与 Llama (sequential GQA) 和 Qwen\\n(sequential GQA + RoPE variant) 架构差异最大。within-lang acc 落在 0.69-0.73 因 Gemma\\n多语言训练配比适中（英语占优但中文覆盖不如 Qwen）。不对称性方向一致（ZH→EN > EN→ZH）\\n源于相同底层机制——英语作为训练主导语言的表征锚点效应——与架构无关。但 gap 缩小至 5.4pp\\n（vs 7.2pp），因 Gemma 的 parallel attention 提供更均匀的跨层信息流动，降低了方向性\\n映射难度差异。CI 含零因: (1) 样本量 ~1000 在 5.4pp effect 下 power 不足, (2) Gemma\\n的 attention pattern 引入更大 per-sample 方差。94/100 bootstrap 正向但不足以排除零。\\nMLP gain +3.1pp 弱方向，介于 Qwen(2.3pp) 和 Llama(4.7pp corrected) 之间。\\nbest_layer 深度 72% 与 Qwen(67%) 更接近而非 Llama(88%)，暗示峰值层与架构深度分配\\n有关而非固定比例——C4 需更多模型确认 pattern。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"多语言扩展 (EN↔JA)\",\n    \"description\": \"扩展到 EN↔JA 语言对，测试不对称性是否与 typological distance 相关\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"model_tested\": \"Llama-3.1-8B (primary) + Qwen3-8B (if time permits)\",\n      \"ja_translation_comet_mean\": 0.74,\n      \"ja_translation_pass_rate_080\": 0.22,\n      \"en_en_bal_acc\": 0.771,\n      \"ja_ja_bal_acc\": 0.673,\n      \"en_ja_bal_acc\": 0.612,\n      \"ja_en_bal_acc\": 0.658,\n      \"asymmetry_gap_pp\": 4.6,\n      \"bootstrap_ci_95\": \"[-2.1%, 11.3%]\",\n      \"bootstrap_significant\": false,\n      \"positive_iterations_of_100\": 88,\n      \"sample_size_ja\": 680,\n      \"conflictqa_ja_coverage\": 0.68\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"EN↔JA probe transfer (Llama-3.1-8B, n=680)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Train→Test\",\n          \"Bal. Acc (%)\",\n          \"95% CI\",\n          \"Perm. p\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"EN→EN\",\n            \"77.1\",\n            \"[74.3, 79.9]\",\n            \"<0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"JA→JA\",\n            \"67.3\",\n            \"[63.5, 71.1]\",\n            \"<0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"EN→JA\",\n            \"61.2\",\n            \"[56.9, 65.5]\",\n            \"0.021\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"JA→EN\",\n            \"65.8\",\n            \"[61.6, 70.0]\",\n            \"0.002\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Gap (JA→EN − EN→JA)\",\n            \"+4.6\",\n            \"[-2.1, 11.3]\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Cross-language-pair asymmetry comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Language Pair\",\n          \"Gap (pp)\",\n          \"95% CI\",\n          \"n\",\n          \"Direction\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"EN↔ZH (Llama)\",\n            \"7.22\",\n            \"[1.1, 13.6]\",\n            \"~1000\",\n            \"ZH→EN > EN→ZH\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"EN↔JA (Llama)\",\n            \"4.6\",\n            \"[-2.1, 11.3]\",\n            \"~680\",\n            \"JA→EN > EN→JA\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"EN↔JA 方向一致支持 H1 的 English-anchored 假设——不管目标语言是 ZH 还是 JA，\\nX→EN 迁移都优于 EN→X。但 gap 差异 (7.2 vs 4.6pp) 的解释有混淆: 可能是\\ntypological distance 效应 (支持 H2 的弱形式) 或纯粹是 sample size/coverage 导致的\\npower 差异。此实验为 \\\"方向一致但样本量不足以单独显著\\\" 的典型 median-tier 结果。\\n论文中作为 supplementary evidence 放 Discussion，不宜作为独立 claim。\\n贡献: 将 lang_pairs_validated 从 1 提升到 2，满足 RC4 的最低要求。\\n\\n\\nJA 预测结果弱于 ZH 有三个原因: (1) ConflictQA 中 JA 实体覆盖率低于 ZH（Wikidata\\nJA 标签覆盖不如 ZH），可用样本 ~680 vs ZH ~1000; (2) JA 作为 agglutinative 语言，\\ntokenizer 切分更碎片化，信息密度/token 低于 ZH，探针输入质量略降; (3) Llama-3.1 的\\nJA 训练数据占比低于 ZH，within-lang acc 偏低。\\n不对称性方向一致（JA→EN > EN→JA）因相同锚点机制——英语表征空间主导。gap 4.6pp 略\\n小于 ZH 的 7.2pp，可能因 JA-EN typological distance 大于 ZH-EN（JA 是 SOV 语序 +\\nagglutinative，ZH 是 SVO + isolating），映射两个方向都更难，压缩了不对称性。\\nCI 含零主要因样本量不足 (n=680) 导致 power 严重不足。direction consistency 才是关键。\\n这个结果对 H1 vs H2 判别力弱——两个假说都兼容此 pattern。需更多语言对（DE, AR）\\n才能有效区分。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Layer-wise CKA/SVCCA\",\n    \"description\": \"逐层 CKA + SVCCA 分析 EN vs ZH 表征相似度变化，对接 language transition 文献\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cka_early_layers_0_to_25pct\": 0.92,\n      \"cka_mid_layers_25_to_60pct\": 0.78,\n      \"cka_upper_layers_60_to_85pct\": 0.71,\n      \"cka_final_layers_85_to_100pct\": 0.63,\n      \"svcca_correlation_with_cka\": 0.94,\n      \"language_transition_onset_layer_pct\": 0.55,\n      \"probe_peak_vs_cka_drop_correlation\": -0.67,\n      \"cka_conflict_vs_nonconflict_diff_peak_layer\": 0.08\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Layer-wise CKA between EN and ZH conflict activations (Llama-3.1-8B)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Layer Range\",\n          \"Depth %\",\n          \"CKA (mean)\",\n          \"CKA (std)\",\n          \"Probe Acc (%)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"0-8\",\n            \"0-25%\",\n            \"0.92\",\n            \"0.03\",\n            \"54.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"8-19\",\n            \"25-60%\",\n            \"0.78\",\n            \"0.05\",\n            \"62.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"19-27\",\n            \"60-85%\",\n            \"0.71\",\n            \"0.04\",\n            \"73.6\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"27-32\",\n            \"85-100%\",\n            \"0.63\",\n            \"0.06\",\n            \"69.1\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Language transition onset across models\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Transition Onset (%)\",\n          \"Probe Peak (%)\",\n          \"CKA at Peak\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            \"55%\",\n            \"88%\",\n            \"0.64\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            \"50%\",\n            \"67%\",\n            \"0.73\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Gemma-2-9B-IT\",\n            \"52%\",\n            \"72%\",\n            \"0.70\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"CKA 下降曲线 + probe peak 的共现为 C4 提供了 mechanistic 叙事: \\\"冲突信号在语言表征\\n从 universal 向 specific 转变的过程中达到峰值\\\"。但三模型 peak 层分散 (67-88%)\\n削弱了 \\\"固定比例\\\" 的 claim。改为: \\\"conflict detection peaks during the language\\ntransition window, whose exact location is architecture-dependent\\\"。\\nCKA conflict vs non-conflict 差异 (0.08) 太小，不支持 \\\"冲突改变了跨语言对齐\\\" 这种\\n强 claim。应限定为描述性发现。此实验是论文 Section 4.3 的核心图表来源。\\n\\n\\nCKA 从 early layers (~0.92) 单调下降到 final layers (~0.63) 符合 \\\"Lost in\\nMultilinguality\\\" (Wendler et al. 2024) 的 language transition 预测: 模型在 mid-upper\\nlayers 开始将 language-universal 语义表征转换为 language-specific 输出表征。\\ntransition onset ~55% depth 与 Wendler 的 60% 接近（Wendler 用更大模型，transition\\n更靠后）。probe accuracy peak 出现在 CKA 开始快速下降的区域——这是核心发现:\\n冲突信号在语言表征开始分化的 \\\"临界层\\\" 最强，暗示冲突检测发生在 universal→specific\\ntransition 过程中。但 conflict vs non-conflict 的 CKA 差异仅 0.08（peak 层），\\n不够大到支持强结论。SVCCA 与 CKA 高度一致 (r=0.94) 增加方法鲁棒性。\\n此实验提供 C4 (layer structure) 的核心证据，但 peak 层跨模型不一致 (Llama 88%,\\nQwen 67%, Gemma 72%) 使得 \\\"universal pattern\\\" claim 困难。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Representation steering (干预实验)\",\n    \"description\": \"用探针方向作 steering vector 干预残差流，测量模型输出的因果变化\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"steering_method\": \"probe_weight_direction_addition\",\n      \"strong_direction_zh_en_flip_rate\": 0.34,\n      \"weak_direction_en_zh_flip_rate\": 0.18,\n      \"steering_alpha_optimal\": 3.5,\n      \"coherence_preservation_rate\": 0.72,\n      \"parametric_to_contextual_flip_rate\": 0.28,\n      \"contextual_to_parametric_flip_rate\": 0.22,\n      \"random_direction_flip_rate\": 0.06,\n      \"steering_effect_significant\": true,\n      \"steering_effect_size_cohens_d\": 0.41\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Steering intervention results (Llama-3.1-8B, best layer)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"Flip Rate (%)\",\n          \"Coherence (%)\",\n          \"Random Ctrl (%)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"ZH→EN probe direction\",\n            \"34.2\",\n            \"74.1\",\n            \"5.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"EN→ZH probe direction\",\n            \"18.1\",\n            \"71.3\",\n            \"6.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Averaged probe direction\",\n            \"26.5\",\n            \"72.8\",\n            \"6.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Random orthogonal direction\",\n            \"6.0\",\n            \"89.5\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Steering alpha sensitivity (ZH→EN direction)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Alpha\",\n          \"Flip Rate (%)\",\n          \"Coherence (%)\",\n          \"Net Useful Flips (%)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"1.0\",\n            \"12.3\",\n            \"91.2\",\n            \"11.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2.0\",\n            \"22.8\",\n            \"84.6\",\n            \"19.3\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"3.5\",\n            \"34.2\",\n            \"74.1\",\n            \"25.3\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"5.0\",\n            \"38.9\",\n            \"58.3\",\n            \"22.7\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"7.0\",\n            \"41.2\",\n            \"42.1\",\n            \"17.3\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Steering 提供了有限但实在的因果证据: probe direction 操纵可改变输出，且效果与\\nrandom direction 显著不同 (p<0.001)。但 34% flip rate 不足以声称 \\\"冲突信号因果\\n控制冲突解决\\\"——更准确的 framing 是 \\\"探针捕获的方向与冲突解决机制相关联\\\"。\\n论文中放在 Discussion 的 \\\"Towards Causal Understanding\\\" 小节，明确 limitation:\\n\\\"Our steering results provide correlational evidence consistent with a causal role\\nfor the detected conflict signal. Definitive causal claims require activation\\npatching or distributed alignment search, which we leave to future work.\\\"\\n不对称 flip rate (34 vs 18%) 与探针不对称性 echo，strengthens C2 narrative。\\n\\n\\nProbe weight 方向包含冲突检测信号但非纯因果方向——探针学到的是 \\\"与冲突相关的方差方向\\\"\\n而非 \\\"因果控制冲突解决的方向\\\"。因此 flip rate 偏低 (~18-34%) 而非理想的 50%+。\\nZH→EN 方向 flip rate (34%) 高于 EN→ZH (18%)，与探针迁移不对称性一致: ZH→EN\\n探针捕获了更纯粹的冲突信号，steering 更有效。EN→ZH 方向的非线性成分 (MLP gain)\\n意味着线性 steering vector 无法充分捕获该方向的冲突信号。\\nalpha=3.5 是 coherence-effectiveness trade-off: 过大导致输出退化 (coherence < 60%),\\n过小无效果。random direction control (6% flip) 证明效果非随机。\\nCohen's d=0.41 (medium) 提供 \\\"correlational evidence consistent with causal role\\\"\\n但不是 clean causal demonstration (那需要 activation patching 或 DAS)。\\n此实验在 Track 3 缺席时成为 RC8 的唯一因果证据来源。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"探针权重可视化 + PCA\",\n    \"description\": \"最优层探针权重 PCA/t-SNE 可视化，展示冲突 vs 非冲突的表征分布\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"pca_variance_explained_2d\": 0.23,\n      \"conflict_nonconflict_cluster_silhouette\": 0.31,\n      \"en_zh_overlap_coefficient_mid_layer\": 0.62,\n      \"en_zh_overlap_coefficient_late_layer\": 0.41,\n      \"cross_lingual_centroid_distance_mid\": 1.24,\n      \"cross_lingual_centroid_distance_late\": 2.08\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"PCA cluster metrics across layers\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Layer\",\n          \"Depth %\",\n          \"Silhouette\",\n          \"EN-ZH Overlap\",\n          \"Centroid Dist.\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Layer 10\",\n            \"31%\",\n            \"0.18\",\n            \"0.78\",\n            \"0.82\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Layer 18\",\n            \"56%\",\n            \"0.28\",\n            \"0.62\",\n            \"1.24\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Layer 25\",\n            \"78%\",\n            \"0.31\",\n            \"0.48\",\n            \"1.73\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Layer 28\",\n            \"88%\",\n            \"0.34\",\n            \"0.41\",\n            \"2.08\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"PCA 可视化的价值是 illustrative 而非 evidentiary。主要功能: (1) 直觉展示 \\\"冲突信号\\n为什么能跨语言迁移\\\"——mid-layer 两种语言的 conflict 表征在同一区域; (2) 直觉展示\\n\\\"为什么迁移不完美\\\"——overlap 不是 100%。不应过度解读 silhouette 值。\\n放在论文 Figure 3，caption 明确标注 \\\"illustrative; quantitative analysis in Table 2\\\"。\\n\\n\\n前 2 PC 仅解释 23% 方差——高维表征在低维投影中信息丢失严重，这是 known limitation。\\nSilhouette 0.31 (weak clustering) 意味着 conflict vs non-conflict 不是 clean 分离\\n而是有 substantial overlap，符合 balanced accuracy ~75% (非 95%+) 的预期。\\n关键定性发现: mid-layer 中 EN 和 ZH conflict 点云的重叠 (overlap=0.62) 显著高于\\nlate-layer (0.41)——支持 H1 的 \\\"mid-layer 共享表征\\\" 假设。EN conflict 和 ZH\\nconflict 的 centroid distance 从 mid (1.24) 到 late (2.08) 增大，与 CKA 下降一致。\\n但这是低维投影的定性证据，不能独立支持 claim。作为 Figure 3 (illustrative) 使用。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Label noise ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"注入 5-20% label noise 评估探针对 verification pipeline 标注错误的鲁棒性\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"noise_0pct_acc\": 0.771,\n      \"noise_5pct_acc\": 0.758,\n      \"noise_10pct_acc\": 0.738,\n      \"noise_15pct_acc\": 0.704,\n      \"noise_20pct_acc\": 0.668,\n      \"degradation_5pct_pp\": -1.3,\n      \"degradation_10pct_pp\": -3.3,\n      \"degradation_15pct_pp\": -6.7,\n      \"degradation_20pct_pp\": -10.3,\n      \"estimated_pipeline_error_rate\": 0.04,\n      \"noise_tolerance_threshold\": 0.1\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Probe accuracy under systematic label noise (Llama-3.1-8B, EN→EN)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Noise Rate\",\n          \"Bal. Acc (%)\",\n          \"Delta (pp)\",\n          \"95% CI\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"0%\",\n            \"77.1\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"[74.3, 79.9]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"5%\",\n            \"75.8\",\n            \"-1.3\",\n            \"[72.9, 78.7]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"10%\",\n            \"73.8\",\n            \"-3.3\",\n            \"[70.7, 76.9]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"15%\",\n            \"70.4\",\n            \"-6.7\",\n            \"[67.0, 73.8]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"20%\",\n            \"66.8\",\n            \"-10.3\",\n            \"[63.1, 70.5]\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Pipeline error rate 4% 处的 accuracy 损失仅 ~1pp，远小于 CI 宽度——label noise\\n对结论无实质影响。此实验直接回应 \\\"你的 verification pipeline 可能有错\\\" 的 reviewer\\nconcern，以实验代替争论。放 Appendix，一图一表足够。\\n\\n\\n探针在 0-10% noise 下温和退化（-1 到 -3pp），10-20% 区间加速退化——典型的线性探针\\nnoise sensitivity 曲线。此 pattern 因线性模型对 label noise 的 theoretical\\nrobustness: 当 noise 远低于 signal (acc >> 50%), label flips 对决策边界影响被多数\\n正确样本 \\\"稀释\\\"。但超过 ~10% 后 signal-to-noise 下降导致边界显著偏移。\\nverification pipeline (ConflictQA 的 parametric/contextual answer 匹配) 的估计\\nerror rate ~4%，远低于 10% tolerance threshold。这证明 C1 的探针 accuracy 不是\\nlabel noise 的 artifact。补充 Appendix A 的 robustness 证据。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"更大数据集验证\",\n    \"description\": \"扩大到 2000+ samples 或引入额外数据集验证 C1\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"expanded_sample_size\": 1800,\n      \"expansion_method\": \"ConflictQA additional sampling + ParaRel-conflict subset\",\n      \"en_en_acc_expanded\": 0.765,\n      \"asymmetry_gap_pp_expanded\": 7.0,\n      \"ci_width_reduction_pct\": 35,\n      \"bootstrap_ci_expanded\": \"[2.3%, 11.7%]\",\n      \"bootstrap_significant_expanded\": true,\n      \"new_dataset_consistency\": 0.92\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Dataset expansion effect on asymmetry CI (Llama-3.1-8B)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Dataset\",\n          \"n\",\n          \"Gap (pp)\",\n          \"95% CI\",\n          \"Significant?\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"ConflictQA original\",\n            \"~1000\",\n            \"7.22\",\n            \"[1.1, 13.6]\",\n            \"Yes (borderline)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ConflictQA expanded\",\n            \"~1500\",\n            \"7.0\",\n            \"[1.8, 12.2]\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"+ ParaRel subset\",\n            \"~1800\",\n            \"7.0\",\n            \"[2.3, 11.7]\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"主要价值: 将 Llama 从 borderline significant 提升为 comfortably significant，\\n增强 C2 的统计基础。但如果 Qwen 仍不显著，核心叙事不变——仍是 \\\"consistent effect\\nsize, varying power\\\"。此实验是 \\\"nice to have\\\" 而非 game-changer。\\n若时间紧张，优先做 plan_102 (第三模型) 和 plan_107 (steering) 而非此项。\\n\\n\\n样本量从 ~1000 扩至 ~1800 (1.8x) 使 CI 宽度缩减约 35% (sqrt(1.8) ≈ 1.34 倍\\nprecision)。在 Llama 上，这足以将 borderline significant CI [1.1, 13.6] 收紧为\\n[2.3, 11.7]——更 comfortably 排除零。但 Qwen 可能仍含零 (从 [-1.2, 13.4] 到\\n[-0.2, 12.5] 左右)。within-lang accuracy 略降 (77.1→76.5) 因新增样本包含更多\\n\\\"difficult\\\" cases (ConflictQA 的 easy cases 先被采样)。\\nParaRel-conflict subset 与 ConflictQA 的一致性 0.92 (探针在两个数据集的准确率\\n高度相关) 增加 ecological validity。但此实验 P1 优先级在 median tier 下可能\\n不完整——若只完成 ConflictQA 扩展 (n=1500) 而没做 ParaRel，仍有价值但有限。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Qwen-Scope SAE 冲突特征识别\",\n    \"description\": \"用 Qwen-Scope 预训练 SAE 分析冲突激活的差异化特征\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sae_model\": \"Qwen-Scope (Qwen3-8B-Base)\",\n      \"total_sae_features\": 65536,\n      \"conflict_activated_features_top\": 280,\n      \"mi_selected_features\": 45,\n      \"mi_threshold\": 0.15,\n      \"top_feature_activation_diff\": 2.3,\n      \"feature_interpretability_rate\": 0.35,\n      \"cross_lingual_overlap_top_features\": 8,\n      \"noise_level\": \"high\",\n      \"base_instruct_mismatch_cosine\": 0.71\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"SAE conflict feature statistics (Qwen-Scope, layer 22)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"EN\",\n          \"ZH\",\n          \"Overlap\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Activated features (>2σ)\",\n            \"312\",\n            \"256\",\n            \"78\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MI-selected (>0.15)\",\n            \"45\",\n            \"42\",\n            \"8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Interpretable (manual)\",\n            \"16/45\",\n            \"14/42\",\n            \"3/8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mean activation diff (conflict-control)\",\n            \"2.31\",\n            \"1.87\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Track 2 在 median tier 下产出 noisy 但非完全无用的结果。关键判断: base/instruct\\nmismatch 是主要 noise 来源而非冲突信号不存在。论文中可报告为:\\n\\\"Preliminary SAE analysis using Qwen-Scope identified candidate conflict features,\\nbut the base-instruct distribution shift (cosine similarity 0.71) introduced\\nsubstantial noise. We report these results in Appendix B with the caveat that\\nSAE analysis on matched base-model activations is needed for definitive conclusions.\\\"\\n此实验本身成为 Track 2 的 \\\"learned limitation\\\"——方法论贡献。\\n\\n\\nQwen-Scope SAE 训练在 base model，用于 instruct model 分析存在分布偏移 (RC6)。\\nBase-instruct cosine similarity ~0.71 意味着约 30% 的激活模式不对齐，导致 SAE\\nreconstruction quality 下降，特征识别 noisy。MI-selected 45 个特征中，手动检查\\n可解释的仅 35% (其余激活模式无法对应到 human-interpretable concept)。\\nconflict-activated 特征数 (280) 远多于预期——许多是 false positive，因 base/instruct\\nmismatch 导致 SAE 将 instruct-specific pattern 误解码为多个稀疏特征。\\nEN 和 ZH 的 top MI features 重叠仅 8 个 (8/45 ≈ 18%)，初步看似支持 H2\\n(language-specific)，但更可能是 noise + mismatch artifact。此结果在 median tier\\n属于 \\\"results noisy\\\" 范畴，不足以支持 C5 claim。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LangFIR 语言特征解耦\",\n    \"description\": \"LangFIR random-token filtering 识别 language-identity 特征并从 conflict features 中排除\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"langfir_language_features_identified\": 120,\n      \"conflict_language_overlap\": 22,\n      \"overlap_rate\": 0.49,\n      \"residual_conflict_features_after_filtering\": 23,\n      \"residual_cross_lingual_overlap\": 3,\n      \"residual_interpretability\": 0.22\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"LangFIR conflict-language feature decomposition\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Category\",\n          \"Count\",\n          \"Cross-lingual Overlap\",\n          \"Interpretable\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"All MI-selected conflict features\",\n            \"45\",\n            \"8 (18%)\",\n            \"16 (36%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Language-identity features (LangFIR)\",\n            \"120\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Conflict ∩ Language\",\n            \"22\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Residual conflict (post-filter)\",\n            \"23\",\n            \"3 (13%)\",\n            \"5 (22%)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"实验执行完整但结论受限于上游 SAE noise。不作为论文 main body 内容。\\n若包含，放 Appendix B 作为 \\\"preliminary investigation\\\" 连同 plan_201 一起报告。\\n关键 takeaway 写入 future work: \\\"SAE analysis on base-model activations with\\nmatched training distribution is a critical next step.\\\"\\n\\n\\nLangFIR 能较 robustly 地识别 language-identity 特征（random token 下仍激活的\\n特征 → language encoding），但当 SAE 本身 noisy (plan_201) 时，conflict features\\n和 language features 的 overlap 判定不可靠。overlap_rate 0.49 暗示约半数 \\\"conflict\\nfeatures\\\" 实际是 language features 被误标——进一步证实 plan_201 的 noise 问题。\\nfiltering 后剩余 23 个 conflict features 中跨语言重叠仅 3 个，可解释性更低 (22%)。\\n此结果不足以支持 \\\"conflict 和 language 特征可解耦\\\" 的 C5 子 claim。\\n在 median tier 下，此实验更多暴露了 base/instruct mismatch 的下游影响。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cross-lingual feature Jaccard 分析\",\n    \"description\": \"计算 mid vs late layer conflict feature 的跨语言 Jaccard 以检验 H1 vs H2\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"jaccard_mid_layer\": 0.06,\n      \"jaccard_late_layer\": 0.04,\n      \"jaccard_diff\": 0.02,\n      \"permutation_p_mid_vs_late\": 0.38,\n      \"h1_supported\": \"inconclusive\",\n      \"h2_supported\": \"inconclusive\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Cross-lingual conflict feature Jaccard by layer group\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Layer Group\",\n          \"Depth %\",\n          \"EN features\",\n          \"ZH features\",\n          \"Jaccard\",\n          \"Perm. p\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Mid (layers 10-18)\",\n            \"31-56%\",\n            \"38\",\n            \"32\",\n            \"0.06\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Late (layers 25-30)\",\n            \"78-94%\",\n            \"28\",\n            \"24\",\n            \"0.04\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mid − Late diff\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"+0.02\",\n            \"0.38\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Track 2 三个实验 (201→202→203) 的级联结果: 上游 noise 使最终 H1/H2 检验无效。\\n这不是 failure——是 honest methodology boundary。论文 Discussion 中写:\\n\\\"Our SAE-based analysis was limited by the base-instruct distribution mismatch\\n(Section B.1). The near-zero Jaccard indices reflect measurement noise rather\\nthan genuine absence of cross-lingual feature sharing. We consider SAE analysis\\nwith matched training distributions a high-priority direction for future work.\\\"\\nTrack 2 整体作为 Appendix B (2-3 pages)，emphasize method + limitation > results。\\n\\n\\n在 median tier 下 Jaccard < 0.10 是核心假设。mid-layer 0.06 vs late-layer 0.04\\n方向上支持 H1 (mid > late) 但差异极小且不显著 (p=0.38)。这是 plan_201 的 noise\\n传播的必然结果: 当 individual feature 识别不可靠时，feature 间的 overlap 计算\\n更不可靠。两个很小的 noisy set 的 Jaccard 天然趋近零。\\n此结果不支持也不反驳 H1 或 H2——是 \\\"inconclusive\\\" 而非 \\\"negative\\\"。区别重要:\\nnegative result 意味着 \\\"我们有 power 检测差异但没发现\\\"；inconclusive 意味着\\n\\\"我们的工具精度不足以检验此假设\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Monolingual→cross-lingual steering transfer\",\n    \"description\": \"用 SpARE 的英语冲突特征做 cross-lingual steering\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"status\": \"not_executed\",\n      \"reason\": \"depends on plan_201 + plan_203; Track 2 results too noisy to select reliable steering features\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Track 3 不执行。论文 Section 6 (Discussion) 标注:\\n\\\"Track 3 steering experiments were deferred due to limitations in SAE feature\\nidentification (Appendix B). Probe-based representation steering (Section 4.4)\\nprovides preliminary causal evidence. Full SAE-based steering across language\\npairs remains an important direction for future work.\\\"\\n\\n\\nTrack 3 依赖 Track 2 提供的 SAE conflict features 作为 steering targets。\\nPlan_201 的 noisy results 意味着无法可靠选择 steering features——用 noise-dominated\\nfeatures 做 steering 实验会产出 uninterpretable 结果。在 median tier 下\\ntracks_submission_ready = 1 (仅 Track 1)，Track 3 不执行是正确决策。\\nplan_107 (representation steering using probe weights) 作为替代提供有限因果证据。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cross-lingual-specific steering\",\n    \"description\": \"用跨语言特有特征构建 steering vectors 并与 monolingual 对比\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"status\": \"not_executed\",\n      \"reason\": \"depends on plan_301 which is not executed\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"同 plan_301。Track 3 整体 deferred to future work。\\n\\nPlan_302 依赖 plan_301 的 monolingual steering 基线。级联未执行。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Typological steering correlation\",\n    \"description\": \"Steering 有效性与 CLEAR linguistic similarity metric 的相关性\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"status\": \"not_executed\",\n      \"reason\": \"depends on plan_301 + plan_103; neither fully available\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Track 3 三个实验均 deferred。论文中 Track 3 仅作为 \\\"planned future work\\\" 出现在\\nSection 6.2 (Future Directions)，与 \\\"custom SAE training on matched distributions\\\"\\n并列为两大 follow-up 方向。这不损害 ICLR 投稿——现象发现 + 方法论贡献 + honest\\nboundary delineation 是 reviewer 尊重的 pattern。\\n\\n即使 plan_103 (EN↔JA) 完成，plan_301 未执行意味着无 steering effectiveness\\n数据可与 linguistic similarity 做相关分析。此实验是 \\\"CLEAR 因果链接\\\" 的最终拼图，\\n在 median tier 下明确归入 future work。\\n替代叙事: plan_103 的 probe transfer asymmetry 跨语言对的 pattern (EN↔ZH vs\\nEN↔JA) 提供 \\\"correlational hint\\\"——如果两个语言对的 gap 与 typological distance\\n弱相关，可在 Discussion 中提及但不作为 claim。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":747,"startLine":1,"totalLines":747}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_017z9KvakB6rW3t9vnqeFvYi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have both the experiment data and the paper framing. Let me also check if there's a paper-writing-norms skill I should read, and the latex-paper skill for formatting guidance.\n\nLet me now write the full LaTeX paper. I need to:\n\n1. Cover all experiments from experiment_data.json\n2. Follow the narrative guidance about C2 framing (effect size stability, not p-value), C1 as primary claim, RC8 as correlational evidence\n3. Structure: Abstract, Introduction, Method, Experiments, Discussion/Conclusion\n4. Include tables for every experiment\n5. Track 2 (SAE) results go in Appendix as noisy/preliminary\n\n\n6. Track 3 wasn't executed, so I'll note that in future work\n\nNow I'm organizing the main body experiments: the Gemma-2-9B-IT architecture validation for cross-architecture consistency, the English-Japanese language pair extension, layer-wise analysis using CKA and SVCCA for mechanistic insights, representation steering as causal evidence, probe weight visualization with PCA as an illustrative figure, and the label noise ablation for robustness.\n\nFor the appendix, I have the Qwen-Scope SAE work which came out preliminary and noisy, the LangFIR language feature decoupling that's also preliminary, and the cross-lingual feature Jaccard similarity analysis that didn't yield conclusive results. The larger dataset validation will strengthen the main findings.\n\nNow I'm structuring the paper with an abstract, introduction, related work, methods section, and then the experiments organized as cross-lingual conflict detectability with the expanded dataset, followed by cross-architecture asymmetry consistency across three models.\n\nI'll continue with the multilingual extension comparing English and Japanese, layer-wise representation analysis using CKA and SVCCA metrics, PCA visualizations, and representation steering experiments. The discussion and conclusion will wrap up the main narrative, with appendices covering the label noise ablation study and preliminary SAE findings.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4255,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13665,"cache_read_input_tokens":23254,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13665},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"unavailable"}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e8bbcfe2-4536-4e05-a4c5-615fca01f226","uuid":"5a32ca00-e36f-473e-bfd3-463b574fb19b"}
